<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Zul</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright</para>
  <para style="h1">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zo shirəm kan Markus rəsh gwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt2">Zo Shirəm kan</para>
  <para style="mt1">Markus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Rəsh gwa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mǝn batisma kǝrkǝmi Yesu guntǝpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ne gǝs kǝ yari zo shirǝm kǝ Yesu Almasihu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Almasihu na bi kǝ mǝn Ibǝranewo rǝsh ni e Mashiha, kan Kǝristi na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas, kup pa rop ju ba pi nupi'e muntu kan shoti ti mir sur gam kǝ ne gǝska markǝm kǝ pi mbap ni.</char></note> Nya Yami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip kor rǝshi tulankur jen na amo wura na</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nya Yami</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Da'a.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gip tulankur kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Aa kar nye mǝn kartǝn bar gǝn cina da'i, muntu kan baa kǝrkǝmi'i guntǝp gi gwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal 3.1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Yar kǝ gon mǝn latǝn bi gip lǝp den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;kǝrkǝmi ni Babom guntǝp kǝ cwattǝn gǝsi, dǝ guntǝp gǝs dǝm na ta'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ar ni Yohana ɗir tǝ den pi mbarǝm batisma gip lǝp na pi wazu kǝ ci atl gam kar Yam kǝ pǝni warwat pitǝnka. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Kan mbarǝm kǝ bi atl kǝ Yahuda kup na mbarǝm kǝ Urshalima ba ri kar ti. Wu den yari warwat pitǝn gǝzǝni, kan tǝ pi wur batisma gip ɓula kǝ Urdun.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana ra dlor na tutul dli ka ta rakumi, tǝ dlǝmat ti na late, kan zas na dom ni'e fingal gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohana yari tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Den kaar gǝno gon baa ɗiri muntu kan manǝm nartǝn gwa, zap kaptǝlan gǝs ma a kǝm a ngus a pǝtli tika da'a. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />A pi in batisma na male, ama tiwo tii pi in batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pi batisma na godetǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Wokoci tawo ar ni Yesu za bǝn kǝ Nazarat gip atl kǝ Galili kan Yohana ba pi ti batisma gip ɓula Urdun. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Nan Yesu den ɗǝltǝn tor gip maliwo, ar ni tǝ shin dlom yam ɓuli, kan Ruhu ba sur dlǝr den ti na dli wule kǝ kuɓǝri. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kan yar gon ba ɗǝl sur yam ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Nya gǝni, muntu a ndu gwa, mbatl gǝn ba ghol nan ki naari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a ar ni Ruhu ri ti gip lǝpe, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />kan tǝ dǝm rǝnka kǝ muri hauya rop, Shetan den ta gode gǝsi. Tǝ ra na ga dabba kǝ gip lǝpe, na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam den pi ti mbapi.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bi mir mǝn kopi gǝs kǝ pari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Den kaar kǝ la'i Yohana gip bom kǝ moniwo, ar ni Yesu ndara gip atl kǝ Galili, tǝ den pi wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wokoci ɗir wi, mulki kǝ Yam mbira kosak wi. Ci ni atl gam kǝ ngǝsh kǝn ni den zo shirǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Nan Yesu den kopi bi ɓula kǝ Galiliwo, tǝ shin Siman na erǝm gǝs Andǝrawus den la'i bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝn gip male, domici wu mǝn nǝmi kos ni. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝn ni, aa pali in mǝn dǝli mbarǝm ɗir karǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a ar ni wu za bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝnka kan wu kop Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Nan tǝ te cina njemo ar ni tǝ shin Yakubu nya Zabadi na erǝm gǝs Yohana gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, wu den kǝrkǝm bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Na shini gǝzǝno ar ni tǝ la wur bi, kan wu za bazin Zabadi gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali na mir mǝn mbap jeni kan wu kop Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ar ni wu ndara Kaparnahum, nan pǝt Shukutǝn ɗiro ar ni Yesu te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda kan tǝ nǝm kulci mbarǝme. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Mbarǝm nǝm bi na am den kulci gǝsi, domici tǝ kulci wur wule muntu kan na iko gwa, ba'e wule kandatu mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ba pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Gip untuwo, ar ni mbarǝm gon kǝn mǝn dun itǝr gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi la yar tǝ wule, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />&lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu nan mi, Yesu kǝ Nazarat! Kǝ ɗir ni kǝ pa'ika nan miya? A mom wo ni'e ki, Dlǝran Mbarǝm kǝ Yami!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Kan Yesu ba matl ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ɗǝl ter gip ti!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Dun itǝri ɓo mbarǝmi atl kan tǝ ɗǝl ter gip ti na la'i yare.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ar dlǝkǝn mbarǝm kup kan wu ngen momi kar ezǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unu ari ituwi? Pel kulci gon mǝn ndǝrtǝni! Tǝ yari argon tu dun itǝr baa pi gwa kan wu kopi ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Shirǝm den ti gǝzan bǝle-bǝle gip atl kǝ Galili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni mbarǝm na womti kumi dli gǝzǝn ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Nan wu za bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayiwo, ar ni ga Yakubu na Yohana ri bom dǝ Siman na Andǝrawus. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Nakon kǝ Siman ra ɓom den kumi dli, dli gǝs wi utuka, kan wu shirǝm na Yesu den ti. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Kan tǝ ri kar nagǝr mǝri, tǝ nǝm am gǝs tǝ tli ti yami. Ar ni kumi dliyi za ti, kan tǝ turi wur fingal tǝ bi wuri.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Gasi kǝ bi sit nan pǝt nda binwo, ar ni mbarǝm ɗiri Yesu kup mǝn kumi dli na mǝn dun itǝri. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ar ni mbarǝm kǝ bǝni kup dom wur bǝdlabǝn bomi, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />kan Yesu ba pǝni ko gonge mbarǝm den ko gonge unu kumi dli gǝzǝnka. Tǝ pa ɗǝli dun itǝrka na womti gip mbarǝme, ama tǝ za dun itǝri wu shirǝm da'a, domici wu mom ko ti wo ni.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Yam las tu mbarǝm ra dagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kǝ bi bǝtloni, nan las'i pǝlǝu-pǝlǝwo, ar ni Yesu tlyami, kan tǝ za bom tǝ ndara las gon kan mbarǝm ra dagwa, lasi ni tǝ shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Siman na munju kan ra nan ti gwa ri kǝ ngeni gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nan wu zam tiwo ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kup den ta ngeni gi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndara ni gip mir bǝn ju kan ra kosak gwa, kǝ dǝ a pi wazu barta esi. Argon tu sirǝm gwa itu&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ar ni wu kop gip atl kǝ Galili kup, wu den wazu gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gǝzǝn na ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba mǝn ndǝcci gon ɗir kar Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ba mǝn ndǝcci gon ɗir kar ti kan tǝ ngus den gam ghurǝm gǝs tǝ lir ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ni pǝni'i mbatlo, kii mani pali gǝn dlǝran.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kii mani pali gǝn dlǝran: Bisa adini kǝ mǝn Yahudawo mǝn ndǝcci den kuur dli gǝso tǝ ra hoyi kǝ tetǝn gip Bom kǝ Yam da'a. </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note><verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Laa'i na guna gere, ar ni Yesu ne am den mbarǝmi kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar pǝnim mbatli, pal dlǝran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a, ar ni ndǝcci gǝs za ti kan tǝ pal dlǝran.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu dǝli ti kǝm hoyi, kan tǝ za ti tǝ ndara. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ yari murgon bar tu da'a. Ama mbǝri, ri gam gi kar lǝɓa kǝ Yami kan kǝ bi bar ju Musa wule dǝ bi den bi paltǝn dlǝran gwa, kǝ dǝ ar dǝm seda kar wuri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ama mbarǝmi pi untu da'a kan tǝ ndara tǝ nǝm yari mbarǝm argon tu kan pi gwa. Muntu kem Yesu ba'i te gip bǝn den ger kǝ mbarǝm da'a ama tǝ dǝm kaari las ju mbarǝm ra da gwa. Kup na untu mbarǝm ko tǝp ako pi ta ɗirtǝn kar ti.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke muntu itǝr tle ti dlika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Murka njem den kaariwo, ar ni Yesu pa te gip bǝn Kaparnahum, kan mbarǝm ba kumka den'e tǝra bomi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti dom wur har kushi ba ɗatka, ko te bǝdlabǝn karika ma, kan tǝ pi wur wazu shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ar ni mbarǝm wupse jen ter na mbarǝm gon kan ra den kumi dli gwa, itǝr ni tle ti dlika. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Nan wu mani zami tǝp kǝ te gǝs kar Yesu da'a na womtitǝn kǝ mbarǝmo ar ni wu tul las gon den rupi kushiyi sur gam dǝ Yesu, den kaar kǝ tuli shuyiwo, kan wu shu muntu itǝr tle ti dli kayi sur cina dǝ Yesu ɓom den bamuri gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Nan Yesu shin ngǝshtǝn den Yam gǝzǝno, ar ni tǝ wul muntu itǝr tle tikayi'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gǝni, ho'i'i warwat pitǝn gi kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Lasiwo mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ra njon, ar ni wu dami gip mbatl gǝzǝn wu wule, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Unun kem mbarǝm kǝn ba shirǝm untu we? Mǝgǝn shirǝm ni tǝ pi Yami! Wo ni baa mani ho'i warwat pitǝnka in ba Yam ni katl nan gǝs dagwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a ar ni Yesu momka gip ruhu gǝs'e argon tu wu den dami gip mbatl gǝzǝn gwa itu, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn den damtǝn den munju we? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Gonge ni ban mani, dǝ wul muntu itǝr tle ti dli kayi'e &lt;Ho'i i warwat pitǝn gi kaya,&gt; ko &lt;Tlyami, pǝn bamuri gi kǝ ndara?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ama kǝ dǝ kǝ mom'e Nya Mbarǝm ra na iko den atl kǝ ho'i warwat pitǝnkawo,&gt;&gt; ar ni tǝ wul muntu itǝr tle ti dli kayi'e, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;A wul ki'e, dlyami, pǝn bamuri gi kǝ ndara bomi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ar ni tǝ tlyami, tǝ pǝn bamuri gǝs kan tǝ nǝm tǝp den ger kǝ kum gǝzǝni. Muntu dlǝkǝn mbarǝm kup kan wu ɗǝɗa Yam na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ taɓe shini argon untu da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bi Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu pa su bi ɓula'i. Ar ni mbarǝm na womti ri kar ti, kan tǝ nǝm kulci wuri. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Nan Yesu den ɓomi asǝmo ar ni tǝ shin Lawi nya Halfa njon kǝ ba nǝmi wurpi bomi. Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni.&gt;&gt; Kan Lawi ba tlyam tǝ kop ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Nan Yesu den ci fingal kǝ gas gip bom dǝ Lawiwo, mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝn na womti, na mir mǝn kulci karti ra den ci fingal nan ti, domici mbarǝm na womti ni gip wur kop ti kaari. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Nan mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa kan mǝn Parise ni, shin ti den ci na mǝn warwat pitǝn na mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomo, ar ni wu ngen momi kar mir mǝn kopi gǝs wu wule, &lt;&lt;Imni tǝ ci na mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝne?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Na kumi muntuwo ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Munju kan ra gingǝlin gwa ni ba shin mǝn bi un da'a, ama mǝn kumi dli ni. A sur ni kǝ la'i bi mǝn pitǝn dlat da'a ama mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi kar Yesu den pi guzum male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Gasi gono mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana na kǝ mǝn Parise den guzum male. Mbarǝm jen ɗir kan wu ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ra imnu mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana na mir mǝn kulci kar mǝn Parise ba pi guzum male, ama mir mǝn kulci kar kiwo wu pi dawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Im ni fa mǝn dǝki kǝ mǝn pel gǝr baa pi guzum mal nan tǝra nan wur gwawe? Wii pi da'a, ti nǝ ra nan wur gwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ama wokoci den ɗirtǝn nan baa pǝni wur mǝn pel gǝri kagwa, gas ta ni wii pi guzum male.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Murgon baa bop gus tutul dli den pel tutul dli da'a. Ti ni tǝ pi untuwo, pel tutul dliyi baa tlyat koriyika, har dǝ dlyattǝni man kǝ fari. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Murgon baa shoti pel mal kin inabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal kin inabi: Ba zam ni mal tu den gǝri kin inabi kan zho gwa. Paye pi ampani na mal kin inabi wule mal tle gip atl kǝ Isra'ila. </char></note> gip kor tat ne mal inabi da'a. Ti ni tǝ pi untuwo, mal inabiyi baa tar tati kan ar mbutlka. O'o, tii shoti ni pel mal kin inabi gip pel tat inabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni'e Babom kǝ pǝt Shukutǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Den pǝt Shukutǝn gon nan Yesu den kopi gip kǝn alkamawo, mir mǝn kulci kar ti ra nan ti, ar ni wu nǝm wumi alkama wu den ci. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mǝn Pariseyi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ɓa shini, unun kem wu pi argon tu den kulci kǝ Musawo ar ndari dǝ pi den pǝt Shukutǝn da gwawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ taɓe ni zhiti gip tulankur den argon tu Dauda pi, ti na ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝs nan guzum ci wur gwa diya? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Kandatu gip muri kǝ Abiyata bar lǝɓa kǝ Yami, Dauda te gip bom kǝ Yam kan tǝ ci bǝredi tu kan ne nika markǝme, muntu kan ga lǝɓa kǝ Yam ni katl baa ci gwa. Kan tǝ pa bi ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝs wu ma wu ci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Pǝt Shukutǝno pi tǝni domici kǝ mbarǝme, ba'e mbarǝm ni pi ti domici kǝ pǝt Shukutǝn da'a. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ra untuwo Nya Mbarǝm ni'e Babom kǝ pǝt Shukutǝn ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke muntu itǝr tle ti amka gwa den pǝt Shukutǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Wokoci gono Yesu te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, mbarǝm gon ra lasi kan itǝr tle ti amka gwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Jen ni den ngeni tǝp tu wii zam Yesu na argon kǝ nǝmi gǝsi. Ra untuwo ar ni wu pi ta ne ger den ti kǝ wu shin ko tii warke ti den pǝt Shukutǝni. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ar ni Yesu wul mbarǝmi kan itǝr tle ti amika gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyam dlor cina dǝ mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Den bi kulci kǝ Musawo unun ndari dǝ pi den pǝt Shukutǝni, dǝ pi ho pitǝna ko wani? Dǝ ɗǝli rai ya ko dǝ ri eka?&gt;&gt; Ama ar ni wu yon gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu wi wur ger gip lo na dun mbatl den lati mbatl gǝzǝni, kan tǝ wul mbarǝmi'e, &lt;&lt;Ta am gi.&gt;&gt; Tǝ ta am gǝsi, kan am gǝs ba pal lau. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ar ni mǝn Pariseyi ndara kan wu nǝm ngeni tǝp nan wur na mbarǝm kǝ Hiridus den kandatu wii ri Yesu eka gwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm na womti kop Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti tlyam wu ndara bi ɓula'i, kan bar womti mbarǝm kan tli tor gip atl kǝ Galili ba kop ti. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Nan wu kum argon tu kup tǝ den piwo, mbarǝm na womti kan tli tor gip atl kǝ Yahuda, gip bǝn kǝ Urshalima, gip Idume, na bi atl ju kan ra te jikat ɓula Urdunka, na gip atl kǝ Sidon na Taya, ba ɗir kar ti. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Den womtitǝn kǝ mbarǝmiwo ar ni tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e wu zami ti nye heli kungǝlǝn jikat mal nǝm, ba dǝ mbarǝm tla ti naarka da'a. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Tǝ pi ni untu domici tǝ warke mbarǝm na womti wi, ar ni munju kan ra na bar jen kan ba ghun wur gip dli gǝzǝn ba pi ta ɗirtǝn zam wu ne am den ti ra. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Wokoci tu kup dun itǝr shin tiwo, se wu nda atl cina da ti wu den la'i yare, wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ki Nya Yam ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ama Yesu dǝli wur kǝm hoyi den ba wu yari den ti wo ni da'a.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zǝzar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet rop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Gip untuwo, ar ni Yesu ndara den tlǝndǝre, tǝ la bi munju kan tǝ ndu gwa, kan wu ɗir kar ti. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Tǝ zǝzar mbarǝm kutl cet rop,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fp" closed="false" /><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tǝ zǝzar mbarǝm kutl cet rop: gip kor rǝshi tulankuri na am jeno &lt;&lt;munju tǝ bi wur sun'e mir mǝn kartǝne&gt;&gt; ra da'a.</char></note> munju tǝ bi wur sun'e mir mǝn kartǝne, wu dǝm nan ti kǝ dǝ tǝ kar wur wu ri pi wazu. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Tǝ pa bi wur iko kǝ ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Kutl cet ropi kan tǝ zǝzari gwa ni'e, Siman (muntu tǝ bi ti sun'e Kepas gwa), <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakubu nya Zabadi na erǝm gǝs Yohana (munju tǝ bi wur sun Bonaji, mimir kǝ Sawa ituwi) <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andǝrawus, Filibus, Batalamawus. Matiyu, Toma, Yakubu nya Halfa, Tadawus, na Siman Ziloti <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />kan na Yahuda Iskariyoti, muntu bi Yesu kagwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ba'alzabub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ar ni Yesu te gip bom goni, kan mbarǝm na womti ba pa kop ti kaari, untu kem ti na mir mǝn kopi gǝs ma wu zam dǝmi kǝ ci barkǝci da'a. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Nan mir mǝn shu bom kǝ Yesu kum untuwo, ar ni wu ri kǝ dǝ wu pali ti ɗir bomi, domici wu wule gam ni duri tika.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ar ni mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa kan tli tor Urshalima ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ba'alzabub ni gip ti! Tǝp kar iko kǝ bar gun dun itǝr ni tǝ ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ra untuwo ar ni Yesu la wur bi kan tǝ shirǝm nan wur na misali tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imni Setan baa mani ɗǝli Setan we? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Mulki ni tatka bomi ropo, mulki tu baa dlǝr da'a. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Bom ni tatlka bomi rop gip shini bes kǝ ezǝno, bom tu baa dlǝr da'a. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kan Setan ni tli gip nge gam gǝsi, kan tǝ tatlka bomi ropo, tii mani dǝmi da'a, patǝn gǝs ɗir ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Na ho bi, murgon baa mani tetǝn gip bom kǝ ndǝri mbarǝm kan tǝ yem bar ju kan tǝra nari kagwa, se ti ni tǝ pare nǝmi ndǝri mbarǝmi tǝ ɓal tika, kano tǝ'i mbu yemi ti bar kǝ bom gǝska. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, kup warwat pitǝn na mǝgǝn shirǝm kǝ mbarǝm den Yamo, baa ho'i wurka. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ama muntu kup kan pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den Ruhu kǝ Yamo baa taɓe ho'i tika da'a, tǝ pi warwat pitǝn kan baa pa da gwawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Tǝ yari ni muntu domici wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ra na dun itǝri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasi Yesu na mir ezǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ar ni nasi Yesu na mir ezǝn cwati, wu dlǝr ter kaari kan wu kar gon kǝ tǝ la'i wur bi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mbarǝm ra na womti njon kar ti, kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nana gi na mir ya'ǝn ra te karika den ngeni gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ga wo ni'e nana na mir ɓyar we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ar ni tǝ bali ger kar munju ra njon kan ngandǝl ti gwa tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ga nana na mir ɓyar ni'e mǝnjǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Murgon tu kup kan ba pi argon tu Yam ba ndu gwa ni'e erǝm gǝn mǝtli na moni na nana gǝni.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulci den mǝn ngani badǝre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu pa nǝm kulci wur ra bi ɓula'i. Mbarǝm na womti kan dom wur kar ti naar gho ar ni kem tǝ to gǝs gip kungǝlǝn jikat male kan tǝ dǝm gipi nan mbarǝm kup ra den bishidi kǝ ɓula'i gwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Tǝ kulci wur bar na womti tǝp kǝ ba kolɗa bi, ar ni gip kulci gǝso tǝ wule, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Kum ni! Mǝn kori bar ri kǝ ngani badǝr gip kǝn gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Nan ti gip ngani badǝriwo, ar ni badǝr jen ro den tǝpe, kan yatl ba ɗir ɗami wu cika. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Badǝri jen nda den tate, las tu atl ra hoyi da gwa. Kan ar ba yetl bǝle-bǝle, domici atli naar da'a. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ama nan pǝt tli torwo, ar ni mattǝn kǝ pǝt kem ar landǝrka nan ar ra na tlǝrti dagwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Badǝri jen nda gip ire, kan ba naari, ama iri dlat wurka, har ba kem ar ɗǝli ge da'a. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Jen gip badǝri nda den ho atli. Ar tli tor kan ba gǝri, gucǝpi bisi hauya nǝm na kutl, jeno hauya myakan, jen ngapo hauya nantam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan ra na kǝm kǝ kumiwo, naa tǝ kumi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Nan tǝra nan gǝso, ar ni mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet ropi na nami kan ra kar ti gwa ngen momi kar ti den argon tu tǝ kulci wur deneyi ba pi nupi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Momi ghuuni bar kǝ mulki kǝ Yamo tare bi in wi. Ama dǝ munju kan ra gip kǝn dawo ko unuwo ba yari wur ni gip kolɗa bi.<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Kǝ dǝ, &lt;wu pi ta zhuwi ama wii mani shini da'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">wu pi ta kumi ama wii mani momi da'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Kǝ dǝ wu pal karǝm dǝ ho'i wur warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka ra!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mani momi kolɗa bi tu diya? Ra imnu kii mani momi nami kolɗa biyi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ba mǝn kǝni ngani ni shirǝmi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mbarǝmi jeno wi ni wule badǝr kan nda den tǝp gwa, las tu ngani shirǝmi gwa. Na kumi gǝzǝni ar ni Shetan ɗir pǝn shirǝmika kan ngani gip wur gwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Jeno wi ni wule badǝr tu kan nda den tat gwa, munju na kumi shirǝmiwo wu nǝm na ghol mbatli. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ama nan wu ra na tlǝrti dawo, wu dǝm ni kǝ wokoci njem katl. Nan tlatǝn ko kumi dli den bi kǝ shirǝmi ɗiro, wu ndaka koshilan. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Jen ngapo wi ni wule badǝr tu kan ngani gip ir gwa, wu kum shirǝmi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ama damtǝn kǝ dǝmi kǝ se na gǝni, na ndu'i bar kǝ am kan na ndu'i bar jen ɗir kan ba tla shirǝmika har ar ba hol gǝritǝni. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ama badǝr tu kan ngani den ho atlo, nan wu kum shirǝmiwo ar ni wu nǝmi, kan wu gǝri ngucipi hauya nǝm na kutl, jen hauya myakan kan jen ma hauya nantam kǝ argon tu ngani gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ne ni pitila te gip kushika kǝ zupka na gal ko te gǝs dandi kaya? Untu ni da'a, kǝ neni den badǝmi gǝs da'aya? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Argon tu kup kan ra na ghuuniwo, ne ni kǝ dǝ ɓulka, kan kup argon tu kan lekawo, ne tǝni kǝ dǝ ɗǝlika kaari. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Murgon tu kup kan ra na kǝm kǝ kumiwo, naa tǝ kumi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu ci cina na shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Neni kǝm hoyi den argon tu kǝ kum gwa. Na shanndǝr tu kǝ cingǝr bar nariwo nari ni baa cingǝri in pa'e, har ma na mbǝli ra. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Murgon tu kup kan ra na baro, baa bi ti ra, murgon tu kan ra nari dawo, ko nye argon tu tǝra nari ma, baa nǝmi tika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolɗa bi den nartǝn kǝ badǝre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Tǝ pa wule, &lt;&lt;Kandatu mulki kǝ Yam ra gwa ikǝni. Mbarǝm gon ri kǝ ngani badǝr gip kǝne, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />se na gǝni, har dǝ argon tu kan tǝ ngani gwa naari, tǝ mom imnu ar pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Atl ba bi bar kǝ gip kǝn na gam gǝsi. Kǝ nǝm ar ba yetli, kan ar ɗǝli gami, den kaariwo kan ar ɗǝli ge. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Na ar ba nyowo ar ni mǝn kǝni baa ri na bar kǝ rǝshi kǝn gǝs den ar mbi den bi rǝshi kǝn wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolɗa bi den ge dǝnti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu mii wule mulki kǝ Yam ra we? Ko ununu ba kolɗa bi dene dǝ yari kandatu ar ra gwawu? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ar ni ra wule ge dǝnti, muntu kan mani heltǝn gip badǝr ju kan ba ngani gwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Na untu kup in nganiwo ar ba naar ar man nami mir kin kup. Ar ba pi am ju kan yatl kǝ to yamka ba mani tu'i bin den mir ami gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na kolɗa bi na bar jen wule muntu na womti ar ni Yesu yari wur shirǝm kǝ Yami, kandatu wii mani momi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Tǝ yari wur bar gon bat na kolɗa bi da'a. Ama ti ni nan gǝs na mir mǝn kulci kartiwo tǝ yari wur ko unu kandatu wii mani momi gwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu matl zhe'e pitǝn kǝ itǝr gip bar ɓul'a'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Gasi kǝ sito Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ te ni den bishidiyi mǝnta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ar ni wu za womti mbarǝmi kaari, kan wu ndara nan ti gip kungǝlǝn jikat male. Kungǝlǝn jikat mali jen ra es nan ti. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kan dun yam ba tli tor gǝsi, mal ba nǝm ghuni kungǝlǝn jikat mali, kan mal ba pare laa'i kungǝlǝnyika. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu ra tǝp kaar kungǝlǝn jikat mali na gam gǝs den bar kǝ tli gami, tǝ den nde umuri. Mir mǝn kulci kartiyi putu ti kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ar ghun ki diya, mǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn wu gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Tǝ tlyami, kan tǝ matl itǝr kan tǝ wul zap mali'e, &lt;&lt;Sa shot! Dlǝr lasi nǝm!&gt;&gt;Ar ni itǝri za'i, kan las ba sa shot hoyi.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kartiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem bǝrti nǝm kǝnwe? Kǝ'i ni ra na holi ngǝshtǝn den Yama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Bǝrti nǝm mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi naari kan wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Wo ni'e muntuwe? Itǝr na zap mal ma wu kop shirǝm gǝsi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni mǝn dun itǝr kumi dlika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti jikat ɓula wu te den kǝti ɓula kǝ Galili, gip atl kǝ mǝn Gerasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Na ɗǝltǝn kǝ Yesu sur gip kungǝlǝn jikat maliwo, ar ni mbarǝm gon mǝn dun itǝr tli ɗir kǝ ba gambǝci tǝ mbor ti. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Gambǝci ni'e ba dǝmi kǝ mbarǝmi. Murgon ra kan ba mbu nǝmi gǝs tǝ ɓal tika na sarsari da'a. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Tla ɓali gǝska am na asǝm na sarsari, ama wokoci tu kup ɓaltikawo tǝ kur ngot sarsariyika tǝ ceccen sarsari kǝ asǝm da tika. Murgon ra kan baa mani nǝmi gǝs kǝ ɓali na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bigul da'a. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ba dǝmi gǝs ni'e ba gambǝci na gip tlǝndǝre, ti den la'i yar na tloyi dli gǝs na tate.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Nan ti shin Yesu terkawo, ar ni tǝ tli na kǝtǝr tǝ te nda ngurup cina da ti. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Tǝ la yar hoyi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun ghun ki namǝni, Yesu, Nya Bar Gun kǝ to yamka? A lir ki gip sun kǝ Yami, ba kǝ kumim dli da'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Tǝ yari ni untu nan Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Dun itǝri, ɗǝl ter gip mbarǝm tuka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu ni'e sun gi?&gt;&gt; Mbarǝmi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Sun gǝn ni'e womti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sun gǝn ni'e womti: Na bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso Lijiyon ni rǝshi, domtǝn kǝ mǝn bi itu kan ri bar kǝ mbarǝm zangu wupse ar ri zangu mukka ituwi. </char></note> nan mǝn ra na womti gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kan tǝ pi ta liri Yesu den ba dǝ tǝ ɗǝli ga dun itǝrika gip las tu kan wu dǝm gwa da'a.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ar dǝm'e kosak na lasiwo womti alade ra den ci bar gǝs tlǝndǝre. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ar ni ga dun itǝri lir Yesu wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kar mi te gip alade juka, za mi mǝ te gip wuri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Tǝ nǝmi wuri, kan ga dun itǝri ba ɗǝl ter gip mbarǝmi wu te gip aladeyi. Womtitǝn kǝ aladeyi ri zangu rop (2,000), kan wu yem sur atl na kǝtǝr wu su ro gip mal wu mǝshka.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Nan mǝn le aladeyi shin untuwo ar ni wu tli na kǝtǝre wu te gip bǝni na mir bǝn kǝ markǝmi, wu yari argon tu kan pi gwa. Mbarǝm ɗǝl ɗir kǝ shini argon tu kan ratl gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Nan wu ɗir kar Yesuwo ar ni wu shin mbarǝmi kan ra har na womti dun itǝri gwa. Nan wu shin ti njon lasi gip tutul dli kan gam gǝs pal semwo, ar ni bǝrti ci wuri. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Munju kan shin argon tu kan piwo, ar ni wu yari mbarǝm argon tu ndo na mbarǝm mǝn dun itǝri na aladeyi esi. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ar ni mbarǝm kǝ bǝni nǝm liri Yesu den tǝ za atl gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Nan Yesu den totǝn gip kungǝlǝn jikat malo, ar ni mbarǝm tu kan ra har na dun itǝri lir ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Za'ǝm a kop ki ngapi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ama Yesu nǝmi ti da'a, ama kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ndara bom kar ya'ǝn kǝ yari wur kiri bar na womti ju kan Babom pi'i na kandatu tǝ shin guna gi gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ar ni mbarǝmi ndara tǝ kop mir bǝn gudǝli kutl kǝ gip atli, tǝ nǝm yari mbarǝm kiri bar na womti ju kan Yesu pi ti gwa. Ar dlǝkǝn mbarǝm ju kup kan kum argon tu tǝ yari gwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tli mǝshi nye gǝre kan tǝ pǝni kumi dli nagǝr gonka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Nan Yesu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ pa jikati tǝ te den kǝtǝyi gon kǝ ɓula'iwo, ar ni mbarǝm na womti dom wur kar ti nan ti'i ra bi ɓula'i gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ar ni mbarǝm gon gip kǝ cina kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, mǝn sun Yayirus, ɗir lasi. Nan tǝ shin Yesuwo ar ni tǝ nda atl cina da ti. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Tǝ pi ta liri Yesu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nye mǝtli gǝn ra bi dǝ mǝshtǝni. Kustu, ɗir ne am den ti kǝ pǝni ti kumi dliyika, tǝ pal lau ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ar ni Yesu ri nan ti. Mbarǝm na womti kop ti kaari, wu den tla'i gǝska. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Nagǝr gon ra lasi muntu kan pi sheti ghon kutl cet rop bǝran den tatltǝn gip ti gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Tǝ kum dli naarwi am dǝ mǝn bi un na jili bar ju kup tǝra nari gwa. Kup na untu, kumi dli gǝso ci cina na naartǝn ni ar dene. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Nan tǝ kum shirǝm den Yesuwo, ar ni tǝ ri tǝp kaar da ti gip womti mbarǝm ju, kan tǝ ne am den bi tutul dli gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tǝ pi ni untu domici tǝ dam ti tor gip mbatl gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a zam a ne am den tutul dli gǝs katl ma, kumi dli gǝn baa pa'i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a ar ni tatltǝn kǝ bǝran gǝs dlǝri, tǝ pa kum gip dli gǝs den tǝ warkewi.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Bar tu ar ni Yesu kum iko kǝ pi bar ɗǝl gip ti, ar ni tǝ bal ti rǝn den womti mbarǝmika tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wo ni ne am den tutul dli gǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa shin womti mbarǝm ju kan den tla'i gi gwa, kan kǝ wule, &lt;Wo ni ne am demǝna?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ama Yesu pi ta kari ger kǝ dǝ tǝ shin muntu pi untuyi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Nagǝr mǝri na momi argon tu kan zam tiwo, ar ni tǝ ɗir ngus cina dǝ Yesu, tǝ den dǝdartǝn gip bǝrti, kan tǝ yari Yesu ge shirǝm kǝ kup argon tu kan pi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ar ni tǝ wul nagǝr mǝriyi'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gǝni, ngǝshtǝn gi den Yam warke i'wi. Ndara bom na ghol mbatli, kǝ zam paltǝn lau den kumi dli giwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Nan Yesu i'den shirǝmo, ar ni jen gip mir mǝn bom kǝ Yayirus kan'e bari kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa, wu ɗir wule, &lt;&lt;Nye mǝtli gi mǝsh kawi, unun kem kǝ pa ghun ba mǝn kulci rawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ama Yesu kar kǝm den argon tu kan wu yari gwa da'a, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, ki de ngǝsh ki den Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ar ni tǝ za murgon kop ti kaar da'a se ga Bitǝrus, na Yakubu, na Yohana erǝm kǝ Yakubu.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nan wu mbubar bom dǝ Yayiruso, ar ni Yesu shin kandatu las pika ghiru-ghiru kan mbarǝm den ta kulu na la'i yar hoyi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ar ni tǝ te gipi kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn den kulu na la'i yar untuwe? Nyayi mǝsh nika da'a, umur ni tǝ dene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ar ni wu gyatli ti. Nan tǝ kaar wurka kup te kaari kawo, kan tǝ pǝn basi nyayi na nase na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ju kan ra nan ti gwa, kan tǝ te gip kupshiyi las tu nye gǝri ra gwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Tǝ nǝm am kǝ nyayi, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Talita kum!&gt;&gt; (Muntu ba pi nupi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Nye gǝre, a wul ki'e, tlyami!&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a ar ni nye gǝri tlyam dlor kan tǝ nǝm desi. Bar kǝ sheti ghon kutl cet rop ni nye gǝri ra na gǝri. Muntu kem mbarǝm ju kan ra lasi gwa kǝ nǝmi bi na am na naari. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ama Yesu dǝli wur kǝm hoyi den ba dǝ wu yari murgon shirǝm tu da'a. Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e wu bi nye gǝri fingal tǝ ci.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ba shin nartǝn kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gip bǝn gǝs da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu za barta kan tǝ ndara bǝn gǝzǝni, mir mǝn kulci kar ti kop ti kaari. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Nan pǝt shukutǝn ɗiro, tǝ nǝm kulci mbarǝm gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, ar ni munju kup kum ti gwa nǝm bi na am wu wule &lt;&lt;Ako ni mbarǝm kǝn zam bar ju untu wu? Unu bopya ni bi ti untu we? Imnu har tǝ mani pi kiri bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am unjuwe? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Muntu ni'e kapǝnta tu diya? Ti ni'e nya Maryamu kan erǝm kǝ ga Yakubu, na Yusufu, na Yahuda, na Siman da'aya? Kan ga erǝm gǝs mir mǝtli ni ɗe nan mi diya?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu kum lo gǝsi.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba hol shini nartǝn kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam da'a se gip bǝn gǝsi, gip dǝngi gǝsi, na gip mbarǝm kǝ bom gǝsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Tǝ mani pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na womti lasi da'a, se mbarǝm njem ni katl tǝ ne am gǝs den wur tǝ pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Holi ngǝshtǝn den Yam gǝzǝn ghun Yesu naari. Kan Yesu ba pi ta kopi mir bǝn tǝ den kulci mbarǝme.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesu la bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet ropi, ar ni tǝ kar wur rop-rop kan tǝ bi wur iko den gam ga dun itǝri.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ pǝn ni argon gip ɓomi asǝm gin da'a, ko bǝredi, ko poshe, ko wurpi den dli gini, se de dlo katl. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Kem ni kaptǝlanye ama ba kǝ yem ni tutul tli rop da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Wokoci tu kǝ te gip bom gono, dǝm ni lasi ar ri gas tu kii za bǝni gwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Las tu kup nge pi ɗem nan kǝn ko wu kum kǝn dawo, za ni lasi kan kǝ bat ni kushka kǝ den asǝm ginka den bi seda den wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ar ni wu ndara kan wu pi wazu den dǝ mbarǝm ci atl gam wu pal kar Yami. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wu ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme kan wu bǝrke mir mbarǝm na womti kan den kumi dli gwa wu warke wuri.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ar dǝm'e gun Hiridus kum shirǝm tu, domici kum sun kǝ Yesuwi ko ako. Jen den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Yohana mǝn pi batisma ni tli gip mǝshi mbarǝme, kan untu ni kem bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju ba pi ra tǝp kar ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ama jen wule, &lt;&lt;Iliya ni.&gt;&gt; Jen ngapo wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ti mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon ni, wule nǝm gip ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon kǝ terka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ama nan Hiridus kum muntuwo, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yohana, muntu a kotǝli ti gamka gwa ni tli ti gip mǝshi mbarǝme!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Domici Hiridus na gam gǝs ni kem ba ri nǝm Yohana ɗir kan ba ɓal tika gip bom moni. Tǝ pi ni untu domici kǝ Herodiya, nagǝr kǝ erǝm gǝs Filibus, muntu kan tǝ gudlumi nan ti gwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Domici Yohana pi ta yari Hiridus'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ndari da'a kǝ gudlumi na gǝr kǝ erǝm gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Ar dǝm'e Herodiya nǝm muntu su mbatl da tika, kan tǝ ndu tǝ ri Yohana eka. Ama tǝ mani zami guntǝp kǝ pi untu da'a, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />domici Hiridus ba kum bǝrti kǝ Yohana, tǝ mom'e Yohanawo mbarǝm mǝn pitǝn dlat kan dlǝran gip dǝmi gǝs gwa ni, ar ni kem Hiridus nǝm Yohana hoyi. Wokoci tu Hiridus kum shirǝm kǝ Yohanawo ar ba ghun ti naari, kup na untu, tǝ ndu kumi shirǝm gǝsi.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Kǝ pa'i bisiwo kan tǝp ba ɗiri. Den pǝt gǝri kǝ Hiriduso ar ni tǝ pi nyel kiri kǝ ga mǝn tloyi shirǝmi na ga komanda kǝ mǝn bi-utu, na kiri mbarǝm kǝ gip atl kǝ Galili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nan nya Herodiya nye mǝtli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nya Herodiya nye mǝtli: Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen na amo &lt;&lt;nya Hiridus&gt;&gt; ni rǝsh lasi.</char></note> ter gipi kan tǝ dlar cina dǝ Hiridus na mǝn dǝki gǝso, ar kon wur naari. Ar ni gunyi wul nye gǝri'e, &lt;&lt;Liri argon tu kup kan kǝ ndu gwa, aa bi'i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Tǝ yari untu har na ɓe am atl tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Argon tu kup kǝ liriwo, ko da baa tatl ni las tu ami gun gǝzǝn gwa gip dlom dǝ bi'i nǝmo, aa bi ika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ar ni nye gǝri te kaari kan tǝ wul nas'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu aa liri we?&gt;&gt; Kan nas ba wule, &lt;&lt;Liri'e dǝ bi'i gam kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Nye gǝri zho ti te gipika kar gunyi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A ndu kǝkǝntu dǝ bim gam kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma gip gal kini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Na kumi untuwo, ar li gunyi mbatl naari, ama nan tǝ yari wi na ɓe am atl kan cina dǝn mǝn dǝki gǝso, tǝ ndu tǝ nge ti da'a. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ar ni tǝ kar dogari gǝs na zhotǝn den tǝ ri bom moni tǝ ɗir na gam kǝ Yohana. Mbarǝmi ndara tǝ ri kotǝl gam kǝ Yohana gip bom kǝ moniyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Kan tǝ ɗir nari gip gal gin tǝ bi nye gǝri, kan nye gǝri ba bi nase. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana kum argon tu piwo, ar ni wu ɗir pǝn tli gǝs wu kapka.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ci na mbarǝm moni zangu nantam (5,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi dom wur kar ti kan wu yari ti bar ju kup wu pi na bar ju wu kulci mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ar dǝm'e mbarǝm na womti den ta ɗirtǝn na ndaratǝno, wu zam gǝs kǝ dǝmi kǝ ci fingal da ma, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗir ni mǝ ndara ni kǝ ba las kan ra zhikai gwa, kǝ zam kǝ shuku ni ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ar ni wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu ndara las tu mbarǝm ra dagwa, wi ni nan gǝzǝn katl. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ama nan wu za lasiwo, ar ni na womti gip mbarǝmi shin wurka, kan wu momka'e wi ni. Ar ni mbarǝm tli ɗir gip mir bǝni kup, wu kop bishidi na kǝtǝr wu pare mbu'i barka cina da wuri. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Na ɗǝltǝn kǝ Yesu sur gip kungǝlǝn jikat maliwo, ar ni tǝ shin mbarǝm na womti. Tǝ kum guna gǝzǝn nan wi nǝra wule tǝm ju kan ra na mǝn le gǝzǝn da'a gwa. Ar ni tǝ nǝm kulci wur bar na womti.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nan pǝt ba ri kǝ ndetǝn binwo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi ɗir kar ti wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Las kǝno murgon ra da'a, ar tu pǝt ba ri kǝ ndetǝn bin wi. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Za mbarǝm ju wu ndara kǝ dǝ wu te gip mir bǝn kan ra kosak gwa wu wuri gam gǝzǝn fingal kan wii ci gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ama Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝno bi wur ni argon wu ci.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝri wur barkǝci na wurpi tu kan ba ɓatl nye mǝn mbap kǝ nde pǝt hauya kutl (200), mǝ ci nan wura?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bǝredi mǝneni kǝn ra nari we? Rii shin ni ɗiri.&gt;&gt; Nan wu kopo ar ni wu zam wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bǝredi nantam ni na kos rop.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e wu wul mbarǝm'e wu dǝm gǝzǝn atl den yari jir bomi bomi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Kan wu dǝm atl bomi bomi jeno mbarǝm hauya nantam nantam kan jen eso hauya rop na kutl kutl. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Nan tǝ nǝm bǝredi nantam na kos ropiwo kan tǝ la gam yami, tǝ goode Yami, kan tǝ ceccen bǝrediyi. Nan tǝ pi untuwo kan tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti kǝ dǝ wu kop mbarǝm rinka wu bi wuri. Untu es tǝ pa njetǝl kos ropi kan tǝ bi mbarǝmi kup. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ar ni kup gǝzǝn ci kan ar ba kǝm wuri. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi yem roɓǝs bǝrediyi na kosi kan wu laa'i shar kutl cet rop nari. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Womtitǝn kǝ moni kan ci fingali gwa ni'e Zangu nantam.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu desi den gam male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ar ri kǝtigon da'a den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu nda cina wu te bǝn kǝ Betsaida. Ti ngapo kan tǝ pali bi womti mbarǝmi kǝ dǝ wu ndara. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Den kaar kǝ pali bi womti mbarǝmiwo ar ni Yesu to gǝs den tlǝndǝr kǝ shirǝm na Yami.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nan sit piwo, kungǝlǝn jikat mali ra te dlom malika, ama Yesu ra ter den bishidi nan gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu shin wu den ndotǝn na dǝli kungǝlǝnyi nan itǝr den ghuni gǝzǝn gwa. Bar kǝ gǝlla am myakan kǝ gaso, ar ni wu shin ti den tertǝn kar wur tǝ den desi den gam mal bar ɓula'i. Tǝ pi wule tii bi wur ni kaari, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ama nan wu shin ti den desi den gam malo, ar ni wu pǝn'e tlon ni, kan wu la yare, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />domici nan kup gǝzǝn shin tiwo, ar ni mbatl tari wurka. Ar ni tǝ shirǝm nan wur na zhotǝn tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dlǝri ni mbatl gini! Ami ni. Ba kǝ kum ni bǝrti da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ar ni tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali kar wuri kan itǝri ba za zhe'e pitǝne. Argon tu tǝ pi gwa dlǝkǝn wur naari, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />domici wu mom argon tu ci na mbarǝm zangu nantam tu ba pi nupi gwa da'a, nan mbatl gǝzǝn mani momi bar mani pi bar tu kan tǝra nari dagwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Nan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti mbubar den kǝtǝ nǝm kǝ ɓula'iwo, ar ni wu dǝm gip atl kǝ Jenisarat kan ba ɓal kungǝlǝn jikat mali bi ɓula'i. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Na ɗǝltǝn gǝzǝn sur gip kungǝlǝn jikat maliwo ar ni mbarǝm ban kǝ momika den'e Yesu ni da'a. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Kan wu kǝtǝr ɗir kar ti tǝp ko ako gip atli kup, wu ɗiri mǝn kumi dli ɓom den bamuri gǝzǝn kup las tu wu kum Yesu ra gwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Las tu kup tǝ riwo, gip bar bǝn na ko nye bǝn ko bi lǝpe, wu ɗiri mǝn kumi dli bi bar pǝte. Wu lir ti den tǝ nǝmi wur kǝ dǝ mǝn kumi dli gǝzǝn ne am den bi lulur gǝsi. Munju kup kan ne am den tiwo kan ba pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Argon tu ba li dǝmi dlǝran kǝ mbarǝm ka gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mǝn Parise na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa jen kan tli tor Urshalima dom wur kar Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ar ni wu shin mir mǝn kulci kar ti den ci fingal na am kan ra dlǝran da gwa, wu ho am da'a ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Munju kan gip mǝn Parise na kup mǝn Yahuda ba ci fingal da'a se wi ni wu ho am gǝzǝnka den kopi argon tu kǝ cina gǝzǝn wule wu kop gwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Wi ni wu za kǝ ba bar pǝt wu pal rǝn bom kawo, wu ci fingal da'a se wi ni wu ho wur kakani. Bar jen ra na womti kan wu zam untun ba pi kan wu kop gwa, wule ga ho'i gal tle male, tat nge male, na ba shoti male.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen na amo rǝsh'e &lt;&lt;har na bamuri&gt;&gt;.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ar ni mǝn Pariseyi na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem mir mǝn kulci kar ki ba dǝm na kopi bar ju kǝ cina gǝmi wule mǝ kop gwa da'a nan wu ci fingal na am ju kan dlǝran ni ar ra da gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn se mbarǝme! Dlat ni Ishaya yari shirǝm kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam den kǝn kandatu ar ra na rǝshi gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">&lt;Mbarǝm juwo wu ɗǝɗa'ǝm ni na bi gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">ama mbatl gǝzǝn dlyamka namǝni.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Wu botem ni katl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">nan kulci gǝzǝno bar ju nya Mbarǝm wule dǝ pi gwa ni.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Kǝ za pi argon tu Yam wule dǝ pi gwawi, kǝn den kopi bar ju kan nya mbarǝm ni wule dǝ pi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ar ni tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi, kǝ mani za'i kopi argon tu kan Yam ni wule dǝ pi gwa den bi kopi bar ju kori gin wule kǝ kop gwa! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Domici Musa wule, &lt;Bi nartǝn be na nǝna gi,&gt; kan &lt;Muntu kup kan zage bas ko naso, dǝ ri ti eka.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ama kǝ wule mbarǝm baa wul bas ko nas wokoci tu wu ndu bar kar ti gwa'e, &lt;Argon tu kan aa ne in am ra nariwo a tare a bi Yam kawi.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Tǝp untuwo, kǝ kem tii'i ne am ga bas na nas da'a ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ra untuwo, kǝ pali shirǝm kǝ Yam dǝmka wop den bi kopi al'ada ju kǝ kulci mimir gin gwa. Untu ni es kǝ pi den bar na womti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kano Yesu ba pa la bi womti mbarǝmi kar ti tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kumǝn ni, ko gonge gini, kan kǝ mom ni muntu. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Argon tu kan ba te gip mbarǝm tǝp bi ni ba li tika da'a, ama argon tu kan ba ɗǝl ter gip mbarǝm gwa ni ba li mbarǝmka cina dǝ Yami. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />(Muntu kup kan ra na kǝm kǝ kumiwo na tǝ kumi.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tǝlankuri jeno wu ra na aya kǝn da'a</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Nan tǝ za womti mbarǝmiwo ar ni tǝ te gip bomi, mir mǝn kulci kar ti ngen momi gǝs kǝ kolɗa bi tu. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ar ni tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ma kǝ hol ni momi ya? Kǝ mom ni'e argon tu kup ba te gip mbarǝm tǝp kaariwo ar baa mani li mbarǝmka da'i da'aya, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />domici gip mbatl gǝs ni ar ba su da'a ama gip tu gǝs ni, kan ar pa ɗǝlka gip dli gǝsi.&gt;&gt;(Gip shirǝm tuwo Yesu yari ni'e kup bar kǝ ciwo dlǝran ni ar ra.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Tǝ ci cina na shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Argon tu kan ba ɗǝl tor gip mbarǝm gwa ni ba li mbarǝm ka. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Domici tor gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝm ni wani damtǝn ba ɗǝli, wani damtǝn wule ga holi nǝmi gami, mure, ri mbarǝm eka, muri na mǝtli ko na moni kaari, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />te ger den bar kǝ mbarǝme, ngarci, setǝne, ndu'i kumi tǝmi kan ra na sham gipi da'a, ghuve, li gami, giɓǝr gami, na kǝdlǝm pitǝne. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Munju wani bar ju kupo tor gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝm ni ba ɗǝli, wi ni ngap wu li mbarǝmka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngǝshtǝn den Yam kǝ nagǝr goni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Nan Yesu za lasiwo, ar ni tǝ ndara atl kǝ Taya na Sidon. Tǝ te gip bom goni ama tǝ ndu ba dǝ murgon mom da'a. Ama kup na untu tǝ ghun kar mbarǝm da'a. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Nagǝr gon kan nya gǝs nye mǝtli den ta ndotǝn na dun itǝro, na kumi shirǝm den Yesuwo, ar ni tǝ ɗir nda cina da ti. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nagǝr mǝriwo mǝn Hellas ni, gǝri kǝ gip atl kǝ Finiks gip Siriya. Ar ni tǝ lir Yesu den tǝ ɗǝli dun itǝrika gip nya gǝs nye mǝtli.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Naa dǝ mimir ci ar kǝm wur kakani. Ar ndari dǝ pǝn fingal kǝ mimir dǝ bi yer<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yere: Kup muntu mǝn Yahuda ni dawo, wu pǝn tini wule yere.</char></note> da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ama nagǝri nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, untu ni ar ra, ama yer ma wu zam wu ci mir roɓǝs fingal ju ba nda sur den tebǝr kǝ mimir gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Den argon tu kǝ yari tuwo, pal gi rǝn bomka, dun itǝri za nya giwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nagǝr mbarǝmi ndara bomo ar ni tǝ zam nya gǝs ɓom den bamuri, dun itǝri ɗǝlka gip tiwi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke bebe kan ngubbi ni gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ar ni Yesu za kǝti atl kǝ Tayaka kan tǝ kop gip Sidon, tǝ su bi ɓula kǝ Galili na gip kǝti atl kǝ Dikapolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Barta ni mbarǝm jen ɗiri ti gon kan bebeni tǝ mani shirǝm da'a gwa, kan wu lir Yesu kǝ dǝ tǝ ne am den ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ar ni Yesu dǝl kurmayi markǝm las tu mbarǝm ra da gwa, kan tǝ kem mir yasa gǝs su kǝm dǝ mbarǝmika. Ar ni tǝ bǝse mo'ǝm kan tǝ taɓe lǝka kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Tǝ la gam yami kan tǝ dǝl bar shukutǝni kan tǝ wul mbarǝmi'e, &lt;&lt;Etpata!&gt;&gt; Muntu gip bi kǝ Aramekwo ar ba pi nupi'e &lt;&lt;Ɓuli!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Na yari untuwo ar ni kǝm kǝ mbarǝmi ɓuli, kan lǝka gǝs ba pǝtli, kan tǝ nǝm shirǝm hoyi. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ar ni Yesu dǝli wur kǝm den ba wu yari murgon shirǝm tu da'a, ama na dǝli wur kǝmo, ar ni wu ci cina na yari shirǝmi. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Mbarǝm ba pi ta nǝmi bi na ame, wu wule,&lt;&lt;Tǝ pi ko onu kor! Ar tu ma tǝ kem munju ba mani kumi shirǝm da'a na ngup bi kǝ shirǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ci na mbarǝm moni zangu wupse (4,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Gip muri ja ni mbarǝm na womti pa dom wuri. Eso wu ra na fingal da'a, ar ni Yesu la bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;A kum guna kǝ mbarǝm ju, muri myakan ituwi wura ɗe namǝni, ngapo, fingal ne wur ra kan wii ci gwa da'a. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Wii ɗatka den tǝpe ami ni a wule wu ndara na guzum gwa, domici jen gip wur ɗǝl ni ɗir na dlyami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Kan mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi ba bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Gip lǝp kǝno ako ni baa zam fingal kan baa kǝm mbarǝm ju gwawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝredi mǝneni kǝn ra na riwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Nyingi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ar ni tǝ wul domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi'e wu dǝm atli. Nan tǝ pǝn bǝredi nyingiyiwo, ar ni tǝ goode Yami, kan tǝ cecceni, kan tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti kǝ dǝ wu bi mbarǝmi, kan wu pi untuyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Wu ra es na mir kos jeni. Ar ni tǝ pa goode Yam dene kan tǝ wul wur'e wu bi mbarǝm esi. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Mbarǝm ba ci ar ba kǝm wuri. Den kaariwo kan mir mǝn kartǝni ba yem roɓǝsi kan sa gwa ar ba laa'i shar nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Womtitǝn kǝ moni kan ra lasi gwa ri zangu wupse. Den kaar kǝ pali wur bi wu ndarawo, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />ar ni tǝ zho ti tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal na mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ ndara gip kǝti atl kǝ Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Parise ngen halama kar Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Ar ni mǝn Parise ɗir nǝm bali shirǝm na Yesu kǝ dǝ wu gode ti ra. Ar ni wu lir ti kǝ tǝ gode wur halama bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn sur yami. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Kan tǝ dǝl bar shukutǝn tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn kǝ ngen shini halama bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn rawe? Na ho bi ni a yari in ne, baa gode mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn halama gon da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kan tǝ za wur lasi, tǝ pal gǝs to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ te den kǝtiyi mǝn nǝm.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisti kǝ mǝn Parise na Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulciyi mǝsǝn ritǝn na bǝredika, se gudǝli nǝm kan wu ra nari gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali gwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ar ni Yesu dǝli wur kǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ngup kǝn ni na yesti kǝ mǝn Parise na kǝ Hiridus.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yisti: Yistiwo nye bar ni kan ba kurtli gip ɗapti pi bǝredi gwa kǝ dǝ ar tli ra.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti bali gip dlom gǝzǝn wu wule, ko nan mǝ ɗir na bǝredi da gwa ni?<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Nan Yesu momka na argon tu wu den bali gip dlom gǝzǝno, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn den shirǝm den holi ɗirtǝnka na bǝredi we? Kǝkǝn ma kǝ'i ni gip dǝmǝn gama? Kǝ pa mom wi da'aya? Mbatl gin i'nika na lati ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Kǝn ra na gere ama kǝ ɗatka gip shini ya? Kǝn ra na kǝme ama kǝ ɗatka gip kumi ya? Kǝ'i dami da'a ya? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Wokoci tu nan a cen bǝredi nantam ju mbarǝm zangu nantamo, shar mǝne ni kǝ yem laa'i na roɓǝsi kan sa gwa? Ar ni wu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Kutl cet rop.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />&lt;&lt;Eso, bǝredi nyingi ju a ceni mbarǝm zangu wupse gwa. Shar mǝne ni kǝ yem kǝ roɓǝsiyi?,&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Nyingi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝn ma kǝ mani momi shirǝm gǝn wi diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke batabi gon gip Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Nan wu ɗir Betsaidawo, ar ni mbarǝm jen ɗir na tabi goni, kan wu lir Yesu kǝ dǝ tǝ ne am den ti. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu nǝm am kǝ tabiyi, tǝ ri ti kaar bǝni. Nan tǝ bǝse batayi mo'ǝm den ger tǝ ne am den tiwo, ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin bara?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ar ni tǝ tli gam yam kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A shin mbarǝm kam, ama wule kin ni den ndǝtltǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ar ni Yesu pa ne am den ger kǝ mbarǝmi, kan ger gǝs ba ɓul tǝ nǝm shini bari hoyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Kan Yesu ba za ti tǝ ndara bom tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ'i te gip nye bǝniyi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus wule Yesu ni'e Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ri gip mir bǝn kǝ Kaisariya Filibi. Den guntǝpo, ar ni tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O fa kǝ kum mbarǝm ba kur wule ami wo niwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Jen ba wule ki Yohana mǝn pi batisma ni, jen ngapo Iliya, jen eso gon gip mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn fa? Ami wo ni kar kǝne?&gt;&gt; Kan Bitǝrus ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Almasihu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ar ni tǝ dǝli wur kǝm tǝ wule ba wu yari murgon shirǝm tu da'a.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari kandatu tǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Gip wokociyi ni Yesu nǝm kulci wur kandatu Nya Mbarǝm baa kum dli hoyi. Tǝ wul wur'e kiri kǝ bǝn na ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam na ga mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa baa nge ti. Baa ri ti eka ama den kaar kǝ muri myakano tii tli ra na ge mbatli. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu shirǝm den bar ju tetla tetla, ar ni Bitǝrus la ti bi markǝm tǝ nǝm matli gǝsi.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ama Yesu bal ti ɗir tǝ shin mir mǝn kulci kar ti, kan tǝ matl Bitǝrus tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tli karǝmka, ki Shetan! Damtǝn giwo den bar kǝ Yam ni da'a, ama kǝ mbarǝm ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ar ni tǝ la bi domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi na mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kup ba ndu kopi gǝno, se tǝ nge gam gǝska, tǝ pǝn kin rati gam gǝsi, tǝ kopǝni. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Domici muntu kup ba ndu ge mbatl gǝso, tii holka, ama muntu kup hol ge mbatl gǝska domici gǝn na kǝ zo shirǝmo, tii ne nǝka. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Unu ho bar ni mbarǝm baa zami ti ni tǝ zam atl kundǝrǝndlip den bi ge mbatl gǝs gwawu? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Unun es mbarǝm baa mani bi den bi ge mbatl gǝswe? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Muntu kup ba kum sham gǝn na kǝ shirǝm gǝn gip zhan kǝn mǝn nge kopi Yam na pi warwat pitǝno, Nya mbarǝm baa kum sham gǝs gas tu nan tǝ sur na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam mǝn tsarki gip ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ Bas gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Ar ni tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt; Na ho bi ni a yari ine, jen ra dlor ɗe, wii mǝsh da'a se wi ni wu shin mulki kǝ Yam cwat na ndǝrtǝn kakani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bager kǝ Yesu cirka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Den kaar kǝ muri mukkawo ar ni Yesu pǝn Bitǝrus, na Yakubu, na Yohana, tǝ te wur den bar tlyari tlǝndǝr gon wu nan gǝzǝni. Wu ra lasiwo ar ni tǝ cirka cina da wuri. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Kan tutul dli gǝs ba palka gholi tar, ar ba pǝn ba gere kandatu kan mǝn ho'i tutul gon ra gip atl kundǝrǝndlip kan baa mani pi untu gwa da'a. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ar ni ga Iliya na Musa cwat kar wuri, wu den shirǝm na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Kan Bitǝrus ba shirǝm na Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ar ndari nan mǝn ra ɗe gwa. Naa mǝ tu mir ba shukutǝn myakan, nǝmo ge, nǝm kǝ Musa, nǝm ngapo kǝ Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Tǝ mom argon tu nan tǝ yari gwa da'a, domici ti na nami mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi kum bǝrti naari.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ar ni dun yam gon sur le wurka, kan yar ba ɗǝl sur gip dun yam ba wule, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo ti ni'e nya gǝni, muntu a ndu ti gwa. Kum tǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Gip untu nan wu kar gero, wu'i shin murgon da'a se Yesu ni nan wur katl.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Nan wu den ɗǝltǝn sur den tlǝndǝriwo, ar ni Yesu dǝli wur kǝm den ba wu yari murgon bar tu wu shin gwa da'a, se Nya Mbarǝm ni tlika gip mǝshi mbarǝm kakani. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ar ni wu za shirǝmi gip dlom gǝzǝni, kan wu nǝm ngeni momi kar ezǝn den'e unun &lt;&lt;tlitǝnka gip mǝshi mbarǝm&gt;&gt; ba pi nupi.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ar ni wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ba wule mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Iliya ni baa cwat kakanu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Iliya ni baa cwat kakani, tǝ kǝrkǝm bar kup. Ama ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam es'e Nya Mbarǝm baa kum dli hoyi, kan dǝ nge ti diya? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ar tu Iliya tare ɗir wi kan mbarǝm ba pi ti ndu'i kǝ mbatl gǝzǝni, kandatu ar ra na rǝshi den ti gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke nye mǝn dun itǝri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Nan Yesu na nami mir mǝn kulci kar ti ju myakani pal ɗir kar nami mir mǝn kulciyiwo, ar ni wu zam bar domtǝn kǝ womti mbarǝm na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa den tli yar yam nan wuri. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nan domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi shin Yesuwo, ar ni wu nǝm bi na am na ghol mbatl kan wu yem na kǝtǝr te kar Yesuka wu shirmi ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tli yar yam kǝ unun kǝ pi nan wur we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ar ni gon gip womti mbarǝm ju nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ar tu a ɗiri'i nya gǝn wi mǝn dun itǝr nan ba pali tika ngupbi gwa. Dun itǝri ba za ti tǝ shirǝm da'a. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Wokoci tu kup ar tli tiwo, ar ba byal ti atl kan dǝ hukǝtkǝt ɗǝli ti ter bi. Dli gǝs ba ndǝrka hoyi kan tǝ ngǝngash shine. A shirǝm na mir mǝn kulci kar ki wu ɗǝli ti dun itǝrika, ama wu mbu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn mǝn nge la'i mbatli, muri mǝneni a dǝm nan kǝnu? Har gigasi ni a mbu nan kǝnwe? Ɓa ɗirim ni nyayi ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ar ni wu ɗiri ti nyayi. Nan dun itǝri shin Yesuwo, na zhotǝne kan dun itǝri ba ɓo nyayi atli, dli gǝs den dǝdartǝni, tǝ den kurngǝltǝne, bi gǝs den ɗǝli hukǝtkǝte.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Kan Yesu ba ngen momi kar basi nyayi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Gigasi ni bar tu nǝm tiwu?&gt;&gt; Ar ni basi nyayi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tun tǝ'i ra nyayi gwani. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ar ba kur byal ti gip utu na male, kǝ dǝ ar ri ti eka. Ama ki ni kii mani pi argono, kum guna gǝmi kǝ nemi am ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Imnu kǝ wule ko aa mani pi argon gwa? Bar kupo mǝn pitǝn ni kar muntu ngǝsh ti den Yam gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Na zhotǝne ar ni basi nya yi tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A ngǝshim wi, nem am a ngǝshim ra den Yami!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Nan Yesu shin womti mbarǝm den ɗirtǝn kar ti na kǝtǝro, ar ni tǝ matl dun itǝri tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ruhu kǝ holi kumi na ngup bi, a wul ki'e ɗǝl ter gip tika, bat na paltǝn teka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ar ni dun itǝri la yare, tǝ luti nyayi hoyi, kan tǝ ɗǝli. Ar ni nyayi nda atl wule mǝshi, mbarǝm na womti ma wu wule &lt;&lt;Tǝ mǝsh kawi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ama Yesu nǝm am gǝs tǝ tli ti yami, kan tǝ dlǝr dlor.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Nan Yesu te gip bomo, mir mǝn kopi gǝs ngen momi kar ti mol, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem miwo mǝ mani ɗǝli dun itǝri dawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Badǝr dun itǝr tuwo tii ɗǝl nika katl tǝp kǝ ba shirǝm na Yami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip tǝlankuri jeno ar ra'e &lt;&lt;se tǝp kǝ ba shirǝm na Yami na guzum male.&gt;&gt;</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pa shirǝm den kandatu tǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Kan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba za lasi, wu kop gip atl kǝ Galili. Yesu ba ndu dǝ murgon mom las tu wura gwa da'a, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Domici ti den kulci mir mǝn kulci kar ti den'e, &lt;&lt;Baa bi Nya Mbarǝmka am dǝ mbarǝme, wii ri ti eka. Gip muri myakan ngapo tii tli lasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ama wu raka gip dǝmǝn gam den argon tu tǝ yari gwa, eso wu kum bǝrti kǝ wu ngen momi kar ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wo ni'e bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Wu ɗir Kaparnahum. Nan wura gip bomo, ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ɗir den tǝpo, den ununu kǝ tli yar yam rawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ar ni wu yon gǝzǝni, domici den tǝpo wu tli yar yam den wo ni'e bari gip wuri.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Nan tǝ dǝm atlo, ar ni tǝ la bi kutl cet ropi, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kup ba ndu'e tǝ nǝra kǝ cinawo, tii palka kǝ kaari, kan tǝ dǝm zher kǝ ezǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ar ni tǝ pǝn heli nya goni tǝ dlǝri ti gip dlom gǝzǝni. Kan tǝ pǝn nyayi am da ti tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;Muntu kup pi ɗem na heli nya wule muntu gip sungǝno, ami ni tǝ pi ɗem namǝni. Muntu pi ɗem namǝn ngapo, ami ni tǝ pim da'a ama muntu karǝm sur gwa ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu ba nge mi dawo gwagǝmi ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Gip untuwo, ar ni Yohana wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ shin gon den ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip sun gi, kan mǝ wul ti'e tǝ za'i, domici gip mi ni tǝra da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ wul ti ni'e tǝ zaka da'a. Murgon ra kan baa pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn gip sun gǝn kan tǝ pa yari mǝgǝn shirǝm demǝn na zhotǝn da'a. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Muntu kup ba shin bes gǝmi dawo, gwagǝmi ni. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, muntu kup kan bi in mal tle wuro mal nǝm, domici kǝn kǝ Almasihuno, ko njem tii hol ɓatltǝn gǝska da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bar mǝn kemi mbarǝm kǝ pi warwat pitǝne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />&lt;&lt;Ar baa dǝm bar kǝ guna dǝ muntu kup kan kem nǝm gip heli mimir ju mǝn ngǝshtǝn demǝn kǝ pi warwat pitǝn gwa. Ar baa mani ti dǝ ɓali ti bar ghuun ɗir yare, dǝ la ti su gip mal bar ɓulaka. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Am gi ni ba kem ki warwat pitǝno, tlo ka. Ar ba mbuni'i mani dǝ kǝ te gip ge mbatl tu baa pa da gwa na am nǝm, na kǝ te gip bom utu na am gi kup pa ropi. Utu tu kan baa mǝshka dagwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />(Lasiwo zhimbǝr mǝn ci gǝzǝn baa mǝshka da'a, utuyi ngapo baa mani mǝshi ka da'a.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tǝlankuri jen ra na aya tu da'a.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Asǝm gi ni ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, tlo ka. Ar baa mbuni'i mani kǝ te gip ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa kurkiyi na kǝ te gip bom utu na asǝm gi kup pa ropi. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Lasiwo zhǝmbǝr mǝn ci gǝzǝno, wu mǝsh da'a, utuyi ngapo baa mani mǝshi ka da'a.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tǝlankuri jen ra na aya tu da'a</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ger gi ni ngap ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, ɗǝlika. Ar ba mbuni'i mani kǝ te gip mulki kǝ Yam na ger nǝm na dǝ la ki gip bom utu na ger gi kup pa ropi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Lasiwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">&lt;Zhimbǝr mǝn ci gǝzǝn baa mǝshka da'a, utuyi ngapo baa mani mǝshi ka da'a.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 66.24</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Baa njer kogonge mbarǝm na utu kandatu ba njer bar tu ba ta'i Yam na mas gwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Maso ho bar ni, ama tǝmtǝn gǝs ni ɗil kawo, imni kii pali rawe? Dǝm ni na mas gip kǝne, kǝ dǝm ni zhǝlili na ya'ǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulci den kari gǝr ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ar ni Yesu za lasika, tǝ ndara kǝti atl kǝ Yahuda, na jikat bi ɓula Jodan. Mbarǝm na womti pa mo gam kar ti, kan tǝ pa kulci wur kandatu tǝ kur pi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ar ni mǝn Parise jen ɗir kar Yesu kǝ dǝ wu gode ti, wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Den bi kulci gǝmiwo, ar ndari dǝ mbarǝm kar gǝr gǝs kaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun Musa wul kǝn'e kǝ piwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Kan wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Musa bi mi bi den'e, dǝ mbarǝm rǝsh tǝlankur ngoti gudlumi, kan tǝ kar tika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Den bi lati gam gin ni Musa rǝsh kan tǝ bi in bi kǝ pi untu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ama terka na ne gǝs kǝ pi baro, &lt;Yam pi wur ni gǝr mǝtli na moni.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ra untuwo, mbarǝm baa za bas na naska, tǝ ni dlakǝt na nagǝr gǝsi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />wu ropiwo wu dǝm nǝm ituwi. Cina ɗewo rop ni wu'i da'a, ama wu dǝm dli nǝmwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ra untuwo argon tu Yam gutlumiwo ba dǝ murgon pǝtlka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nan wu ra te gip bomi ka eso, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu ngen momi gǝs kǝ shirǝm tu. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ar ni tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kup kar gǝr gǝs ka kan tǝ gudlumi na gono, tǝ pi zǝna na ci amana kǝ nagǝr gǝs ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Untu ni esi, gǝr mǝtli ni za bakos gǝska kan tǝ gudlumi na gono, tǝ pi zǝna na ci amana kǝ kosi ituwi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matta 5.32; 1 Kor. 7.10-11 </char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la'i heli mimir albarka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Nan mbarǝm den ɗiri heli mimir kǝ dǝ Yesu ne am den wuro, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti matl wuri. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Nan Yesu shin untuwo, lo ci ti, kan tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Za ni heli mimir wu ɗir karǝmi, kar wur nika da'a. Mulki kǝ Yamo kǝ badǝr mbarǝm ju ni. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, murgon tu kup nǝm mulki kǝ Yam tor gip mbatl gǝs wule heli mimir ju dawo, tii taɓe tetǝn gipi da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kan Yesu ba pǝn mimiri tǝ ne am den wuri, tǝ la'i wur albarka.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm mǝn bar kǝ ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nan Yesu ba za lasiwo, ar ni mbarǝm gon ɗir na kǝtǝre, tǝ ngus cina da ti, tǝ ngen momi kar ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zo mǝn kulci, unun aa pi kan a zam ge mbatl tu nan baa pa da gwawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ wulǝm'e zo'i rawe? Zo'i gon ra da'a se Yam nan gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Kǝ mom bar ju ne kǝ dǝ pi gwa, &lt;Ba kǝ ri gon e da'a. Ba kǝ mur na mǝtli kaari da'a. Ba kǝ pi mur da'a. Ba kǝ bi seda kǝ lar da'a. Ba kǝ cuce murgon da'a. Bi nartǝn bǝba gi na nǝna gi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗǝltǝne 20.12-16, Bi Doka ka rop 5.16-20</char></note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ar ni mbarǝmi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, munju kupo ami ra den kopi tun a'i ra nyayi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu shin ti shintǝn kǝ ndutǝne, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bar nǝm ni kǝ hol katl. Rǝka kǝ ri wur bar ju kan kira nari gwa kup, kǝ bi munju am ri wur kaar da gwa, kii zam bar na naari to yamka. Kan kǝ ɗir kopǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Na kumi shirǝm tuwo, ar ni mbarǝmi li bager ka. Tǝ ndara tǝ den pi dun mbatli, domici tǝ mǝn bar kǝ am ni hoyi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ar ni Yesu kar ger den mir mǝn kulci kar ti, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ba ban naari dǝ mǝn bar kǝ am te gip mulki kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Mir mǝn kulciyi nǝm bi na am den shirǝm tu. Ar ni Yesu pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mimir gǝni, ar baa ban naar dǝ mbarǝm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbarǝm: Kor rǝshi tulankuri na am jeno wu pa rǝsh ra'e &lt;&lt;mǝn bar kǝ ame&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;mǝsh ngǝshtǝn den bar kǝ ame.&gt;&gt;</char></note> te gip mulki kǝ Yami! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ar baa mani dǝ rakumi kop tǝp gip shu alura na dǝ mǝn bar kǝ am te gip mulki kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Na kumi untuwo ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu pa nǝm bi na am wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;O untuno, kan wo ni baa zam ɗiltǝn ituwi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Ar ni Yesu shin wur kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kar mbarǝmo ar baa pi da'a, ama ba'e kar Yam da'a. Rawo, ko unu baro mǝn pitǝn ni kar Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kan Bitǝrus ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar tu miwo mǝ za bar kup mǝ kop ki wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, muntu kup za bom gǝska, ko erǝm gǝs mǝtli na moni, ko nase, ko base, ko mimir gǝsi, ko kǝn gǝs domici gǝn na kǝ zo shirǝmi, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />kan baa hol zami gucupi hauya nantam kǝ zhan kǝn kǝ ga bomi, erǝm mǝtli na moni, mǝn gǝri, mimiri, na kǝne, ama na kumi dli esi, kan gip zhan mǝn ɗirtǝno tǝ zam ge mbatl tu kan baa pa dagwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ama na womti gip munju kan te cina kawo, wii pal kǝ kaari, kan kǝ kaaro wii pal kǝ cina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pa shirǝm den mǝshtǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Wu den totǝn Urushalima ituwi, kan Yesu ra cina, mir mǝn kopi gǝs ngapo wu den kopi gǝsi na nǝmi bi na ame. Munju den kopi gǝs kaar ngapo bǝrti den ci gǝzǝni. Ar ni Yesu dǝl kutl cet ropi markǝme, tǝ pa yari wur argon tu baa zam ti gwa. Tǝ wule, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />&lt;&lt;Ar tu mǝ to ni Urushalima. Baa bi Nya Mbarǝmka am dǝ ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa. Wii tloyi ti shirǝm dǝ ri ti eka kan dǝ ta ti am dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Wii yari ti mǝgǝn shirǝmi, wu bǝse ti mo'ǝmi, wu ɓo ti, kan wu ri ti eka. Den kaar kǝ muri myakan ngapo, tii tli ra na ge mbatl lasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubu na Yohana lir Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Gip untuwo ar ni mimir kǝ Zabadi, Yakubu na Yohana, ɗir kar Yesu, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ ndu'e kǝ pi mi argon tu mǝ liri gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu kǝ ndu'e a pi inu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Kan wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ lir ki'e gas tu kii to gip nartǝn kǝ mulki giwo, dǝ nǝm gǝmi dǝm den am shimli gi, nǝm ngapo den am yali gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ama Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom argon tu kǝ liri gwa da'a. Kii mani tle gip gal kumi dli tu kan a ri kǝ tle gwaya? Untu ni dama, kii mani dǝ pi in batisma tu kan baa pim gwaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, mii mani.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Aan, kii mani tle gip gal tu kan aa tla gwa, dǝ pi in batisma na batisma tu nan baa pim gwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ama dǝmi den am shimli ko yali gǝno, ami ni na iko kǝ bi da'a. Badǝmi juwo, kǝrkǝmi ni munju ne wur ra gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Nan nami mir mǝn kulci kutl ju kum shirǝm tuwo, ar ni wu nǝm kumi lo kǝ ga Yakubu na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ar ni Yesu la wur bi tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom'e, gip munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, munju mom wur na mulkiwo, wu gode mbarǝm gǝzǝn iko, kiri gǝzǝn ma untuni wu gode mbarǝm gǝzǝn iko. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ama kǝno untun ar ba dǝm gip dlom gin da'a. Ra untuwo, muntu kup ba ndu tǝ dǝm bari gip kǝno, ar nǝm ti te yarka dǝ tǝ dǝm wule zher gi ni. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Eso, muntu kup ba ndu tǝ dǝm kǝ cina gip kǝno, ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ dǝm zher kǝ kup. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Domici Nya Mbarǝm ma tǝ sur ni dǝ bote ti da'a, ama tǝ pi bota ni, tǝ pa bi ge mbatl gǝs domici ɗǝli mbarǝm na womti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓul ger kǝ tabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ar ni wu mbubar Yeriko. Yesu ba ɗǝl gip Yeriko ituwi, nan ti na mir mǝn kulci kar ti, na mbarǝm na womti, se mbarǝm gon tu tabi tǝra njon den bi tǝpe tǝ den liri bari. Sun gǝs'e, Bartimawus nya Timawus. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nan tǝ kum'e Yesu kǝ Nazarat ni den wucetǝno, ar ni tǝ tli yar yami, tǝ den wultǝn'e, Yesu nya Dauda, kum guna gǝni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nya Dauda: Mǝn Yahuda ngǝsh wur den'e Almasihu baa ɗir ni tǝp kar gǝsgal kǝ Gun Dauda.</char></note>!<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti mbatl ti wul ti'e tǝ yon shot. Ama tǝ tli yar yam ra hoyi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nya Dauda, kum guna gǝni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ar ni Yesu dlǝri, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;La'im tǝ ni bi ɗiri.&gt;&gt; Kan wu la bi batabiyi ɗiri, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Pi ghol mbatli! Tlyami, tǝ den la'i bi gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ar ni tǝ la bar kǝ ghumtǝn gǝska, kan tǝ kenja tǝ tlyam tǝ ri kar Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu a pi iwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni batabiyi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi a ndu'e a shin bari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Kan Yesu ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ndara, ngǝshtǝn gi den Yam warke iwi.&gt;&gt; Wule gip njǝpkǝr gere ar ni tǝ shin bari, tǝ kop Yesu, kan wu ndara.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu te gip Urshalima wule gunye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Nan wu mbi kosak na Urshalima, Betapaji na Betanya ituwi, kǝ ba Tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaitun, ar ni Yesu kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti rop, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Rǝnǝka gip nye bǝn ta kan cina da in gwa. Na tetǝn gin gipiwo, kii zam nye bar kǝm na ɓali, muntu taɓe totǝn dene wi da gwa. Pǝtl tǝni kǝ ɗiri ni. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Murgon ni ngen momi kar kǝn den unun kǝ pi untuwo, wul ti ni'e, &lt;Babom ni ba ndu'i, eso, tii pali ɗir kǝkǝn tu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ar ni wu ndara, kan wu zam nye bar kǝm den tǝp na ɓali bi bǝdlabǝni. Wu gip pǝtli ituwi, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />mbarǝm jen ra lasi dlor kan wu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn den pǝtli nye bar kǝm tuwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ar ni wu bali wur kandatu Yesu yari wur gwa, kan mbarǝmi ba za wur wu ndara. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nan wu ɗiri Yesu bar kǝmiwo, kan wu la lulur gǝzǝn den nye bar kǝmi, tǝ to dene tǝ dǝmi. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti la lulur gǝzǝn den tǝpi, jen ngapo wu wotl am kin ɗir gip kǝne. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Munju kan ra cina na kǝ kaar dati tli yar yam wu wule, &lt;&lt;Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana na bi kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, ar ba pi nupi'e ɗǝli mi! Den kaariwo ar ni kalmayi palka ɗǝɗatǝne</char></note> Mǝn albarka ni'e muntu den surtǝn gip sun kǝ Babom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 118.25,26 </char></note> gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />&lt;&lt;Albarka ra den mulki mǝn surtǝn kǝ ba gǝmi Dauda! Hosana mǝn nartǝn to yamka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Nan Yesu te gip Urshalimawo, ar ni tǝ te gip bom kǝ Yam tǝ tli ger tǝ shin ko ako. Ama nan pǝt tare nda bǝno, ar ni tǝ ɗǝl kan tǝ ndara Betani nan ti na mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet rop.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pii bi kin turume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Bar dlo nan wu za Betaniwo, ar ni Yesu kum guzumi. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Nan tǝ shin kin turum gon mǝn wol na dlyamiwo, ar ni tǝ ri tǝ shin ko tii zam gǝri dene. Ama nan tǝ mbubaro tǝ shin argon da'a se wol katl, domici wokoci kǝ gǝritǝn kǝ turum ni da'a. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ar ni tǝ wul kin turumi'e,&lt;&lt;Ba dǝ murgon i'zam nyen kǝ ci den ki da'a.&gt;&gt; Mir mǝn kulci kar ti kum shirǝm tu tǝ yari gwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nan wu mbubar Urshalimawo, ar ni Yesu te gip bom kǝ Yam tǝ nǝm kari mǝn wuri na wuri barka lasi. Tǝ pa bat tebǝr kǝ mǝn sanje wurpika na badǝmi kǝ mǝn wuri kuɓǝrka <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Tǝ pa hane dǝ murgon kop te gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yami ka. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ar ni tǝ kulci mbarǝm tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na rǝshi ni ar ra gip shirǝm kǝ Yami den'e, &lt;Baa la bi bom gǝn'e bom shirǝm na Yam kǝ mbarǝm kup.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 56.7</char></note>&gt; Ar tu kǝ palika ba &lt;ghuntǝn kǝ ga mur dlǝri den tǝp wi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irmiya 7.11</char></note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nan ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa kum shirǝm tuwo, ar ni wu nǝm ngeni tǝp tu kan wii ri ti eka gwa, domici wu kum bǝrti gǝsi, nan domtǝni kup den nǝmi bi na am den kulci gǝs gwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kǝ sito, ar ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ɗǝlka gip bǝni.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kin turum tu kan Yesu pi ti bi gwa kon ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kǝ cigǝni nan wi den wucetǝno, ar ni wu shin kin turumi kon kawi tor na tlǝrti gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ar ni Bitǝrus dami, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ɓa shini! Turum tu kan kǝ pi ti biwo, ar konka wi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ngǝsh kǝn ni den Yami! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, mbarǝm ni ngǝsh ti den Yamo, tii mani wuli tlǝndǝr tu'e, &lt;Tus kǝ su nda su gip bar ɓulaka.&gt; Ti ni tǝ cen mbatlka den argon tu tǝ yari dawo, baa pi ti. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ra untuwo a yari in'e, argon tu kup kǝ liri gip shirǝm gin na Yamo, ngǝsh kǝn ni den Yam den kǝ nǝm wi kan ar baa dǝm gegini. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Eso, wokoci tu kup kǝ dlǝr kǝ shirǝm na Yamo, gon nǝra kǝ kum lo gǝso, yape tika, kǝ dǝ Ba gin kǝ to yamka ma tǝ yape in warwat pitǝn ginka. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />(Ama kǝn ni kǝ yape mbarǝm ka dawo, Ba gin kǝ to yamka ba yape in warwat pitǝn gin ka da'a.&gt;&gt;)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tǝlankuri jen ra na aya tu da'a.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jen ngen momi gǝs kǝ Iko kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ar ni wu pa pal su Urushalima ka. Yesu den ndǝtltǝn gip bom kǝ Yam ituwi, ar ni ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa na kiri mǝn bǝn ɗir kar ti. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Na ikoyi gonge ni kǝ pi bar juwe? Kan wo ni bi i bi kǝ pi bar ju kup we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aa ngen momi bar nǝm kar kine, kan kǝ balim ni. Ami eso kan a yari in na bii bi kǝ muntu nan ami den pi bar ju gwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yarim ni, iko pi batisma kǝ Yahanawo sur kar Yam ni ar ɗǝla ko kar mbarǝm ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ar ni wu bali gip dlom gǝzǝn kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ni mǝ wule, &lt;Sur yam ni ar ɗǝlo,&gt; tii wul mi'e, &lt;Unun kem kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den ti dawu?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ama mǝn ni mǝ wule, &lt;Kar mbarǝm no,&gt; &gt;&gt; (wu kum ni bǝrti kǝ argon tu mbarǝm baa pi wur gwa, domici mbarǝm kup pǝn den Yohanawo mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ar ni wu bali Yesu, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ mom da'a.&gt;&gt; Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ma aa yari in wo ni bim bi kǝ pi untu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Kolɗa bi den mǝn pi mbapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ar ni Yesu pare yari wur shirǝm gip kolɗa bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm gon pi kǝn inabi, tǝ gandǝli ka na panye, tǝ bor shu ba zho'i mal inabiyi, tǝ pa tu bom kǝ mǝn ne ger den kǝni. Kan tǝ bi mǝn kori bar jen haya kǝ kǝni, kan tǝ ndara atli goni. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Nan wokoci rǝshi kǝn inabiyi piwo, ar ni tǝ kar zher gǝs gon rǝnka kar munju kan nǝm haya kǝ kǝni gwa, kǝ dǝ tǝ nǝmi ti gǝri kin inabi jen kǝ kǝni. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ama munju nǝm haya kǝni nǝm ti kan wu ɓo ti, wu kar tika am koni. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ar ni tǝ pa kar zheri gon rǝnka. Kan wu pa ɓo zher tu den gami, wu bi ti shame. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Tǝ pa kar gon rǝnka esi, muntuwo ar ni mǝn kori bari ri ti eka. Kan tǝ pa kar jen rǝnka na womti. Ama mǝn kori bari ɓo jeni, wu ri jen eka.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Tǝ'i ra na mbarǝm nǝm, nya tu tǝ ndu gwa. Den kaariwo, ar ni tǝ kar nyayi rǝnka kar wuri, tǝ wule, &lt;Rawo, wii shin nartǝn kǝ nya gǝni.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ama mǝn nǝmi haya kǝ kǝni wul ezǝn'e, &lt;Nye mǝn ci gado kǝ kǝnin ta. Ɗir ni mǝ ri tǝni eka, kǝ dǝ gadoyi dǝm gwagǝmi ra.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ar ni wu nǝm ti, wu ri ti eka, wu byal tika kaar kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu ba mǝn kǝn tu baa pi we? Tii ɗir tǝ ri mǝn haya ju eka, tǝ bi jen kǝnika. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />O fawo, kǝ zhit ni shirǝm kǝn gip Shirǝm kǝ Yam diya? Domici ar ra na rǝshi'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;Tat tu kan mǝn tu'i bin ngewo, ar pal bar ho tat gip tatiwi kup.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Muntuwo pi kǝ Babom ni, bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ni den ger gǝmi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 118.22,23</char></note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ar ni ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami, na ga mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa, na kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda ngen tǝp kǝ nǝmi gǝsi, domici wu mom ka'e den wur ni tǝ bi kolɗa bi tu. Ama wu kum bǝrti kǝ womti mbarǝme. Ar ni wu za ti kan wu ndara.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓatli wurpi bom dǝ Kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Gip untuwo, ar ni kar jen gip mǝn Parise na mbarǝm kǝ Hiridus kar Yesu kǝ dǝ wu zam wu nǝm ti ra gip shirǝm gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Nan wu ɗiro, ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ mom'e ki mǝn yari shirǝm kor ni. Kǝ pǝn mbarǝm kup nǝm ni kar ki, kǝ pǝn'e gon ra kan man gon gwa da'a. Eso, kǝ kulci mbarǝm ge shirǝm kǝ Yami. Gip shini giwo ar ndari mǝ ɓatl wurpi bom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wurpi bom muntu kan mir mǝn atl kǝ Roma ba ɓatl da'a, ama nami mbarǝm gip atli kup ba ɓatli.</char></note> dǝ gun Kaisara, ko ar ndari da'a? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Mǝ ɓatla ko ba mǝ ɓatl da'a?&gt;&gt; Ama Yesu mom ɗasi tu gǝzǝnka, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ ndu'e kǝ borim shuwe? Ɗirim ni kabarshu a shini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ar ni wu ɗiri ti, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Shishidǝr na sun kǝ wo ni dene we?&gt;&gt; Kan wu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Kǝ Kaisar ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ra untuwo, bi ni Kaisar bar tu kan kǝ Kaisar ni gwa. Kan kǝ pa bi ni Yam bar tu kan kǝ Yam ni gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni shirǝm gǝs dlǝkǝn wur hoyi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Mǝn Sadukiya jen kan ba wule tlitǝnka gip mǝshi mbarǝm ra da'a ɗir kǝ ngeni momi kar Yesu, wu wule, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />&lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, Musa rǝshi mi den erǝm kǝ mbarǝm ni mǝshka tǝ za gǝr kaar na mimir dawo, ar nǝm erim gǝs te yarka tǝ gudlumi na gǝri, tǝ zami erim gǝs mimiri. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ar tu erim mbarǝm jen ra wu moni nyingi. Kǝ nǝmi gudlumi, tǝ mǝshka tǝ za nya da'a. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Kǝ ropi ba pa gudlumi na guriyi, ti ma tǝ mǝshka tǝ za nya da'a. Kǝ myakani ma untu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Untu ni kup gǝzǝn nyingi ju, gon ra kan zam gǝri nan ti gwa da'a. Den kaariwo kan nagǝri ba mǝshka. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />To, gas tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmo, gip wuro gǝr kǝ wo ni tii dǝm we nan kup gǝzǝn nyingiyi gudlumi nan ti gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Damtǝn gino kor ni ar ra da'a, domici kǝ mom rǝshi shirǝm kǝ Yam na ndǝrtǝn kǝ Yam da'a. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Wokoci tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmo, moni ba gudlumi da'a, baa ri mǝtli gip kupshi da'a, ama wii dǝm ni wule mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam kan to yam ka gwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Den shirǝm kǝ tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmo, kǝ taɓe ni zhiti gip tǝlankur kǝ Musa diya, den shirǝm kǝ utu mǝn ci gip lǝpe, kandatu Yam wul ti'e &lt;Ami ni'e Yam kǝ Ibǝrahim, na kǝ Ishaku, na kǝ Yakubu?&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗǝltǝne 3.6</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Tiwo Yam kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm ni da'a, ama kǝ mǝn ge mbatl ni. Kǝ jilka naar wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doka mǝn naartǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Nǝm gip mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ɗir tǝ kum wur den bali gip dlom gǝzǝni. Nan tǝ kum Yesu bali wur koro, ar ni tǝ ngen momi kar Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dokayi gonge ni mani naartǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu mani nartǝn gwa ni'e, &lt;Ɓa kum ni mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila. Babom Yam gǝmiwo, Babom nǝm ni. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Se kǝ ndu Banbom Yam gi na mbatl gi kup, na ge mbatl gi kup, na damtǝn gi kup, na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bigul gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bi Doka kǝ rop 6.4,5</char></note> kup.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Kǝ ropiwo ar ni'e, &lt;Kǝ ndu berǝm dǝmi gi wule gam gi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Livitikus 19.18</char></note> Doka gon ra kan man munju naartǝn gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ar ni mbarǝmi wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci kǝ yari dlat, Yamo nǝm ni, gon ra'i da'a se ti. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Dǝ ndu ti na mbatl kup, na damtǝn kup na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bigul kup, kan kǝ pa ndu berǝm dǝmi gi wule gam gi. Rawo, muntu ni man kup keri bar na mboshi Yam dabba gip bota.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Nan Yesu kum mbarǝmi bali ti na bobyawo, ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ dlamka na mulki kǝ Yam da'a.&gt;&gt; Den kaar kǝ muntuwo gon ra kan i'zam bigul kǝ ngeni momi kaar ti den bar gon gwa da'a.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Almasihu nya wo niwe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Nan Yesu den kulci mbarǝm te gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yam kawo ar ni tǝ ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imnu mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ba wule, Almasihuwo nya Dauda niwe? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dauda na gam gǝs, tǝp kǝ ba ndǝrtǝn kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;Babom wul Babom gǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝm den am shimli gǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">se amin a pali mǝn nge gi atli na ba ne asǝm gi.&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 110.1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dauda na gam gǝs la bi Almasihu'e, &lt;Babomi.&gt; Kan imnu fa ti pa dǝm nya Dauda we?&gt;&gt; Womti mbarǝmi kum tǝmi kǝ shirǝm gǝsi.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝli kǝm den mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Gip kulci gǝso, ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Neni ger den mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa, wu ndu la'i kiri luluri wu den ndǝtltǝni, wu ndu dǝ shirmi wur kǝ ba bar pǝte. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wu paye ndu'i dǝ bi wur ho badǝmi gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, na ho badǝmi kǝ ba nyele.<verse eid="MRK 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wi ni'e mǝn ci bar kǝ mǝtli ju kan kos gǝzǝn mǝshka gwa. Kan wu tlyari shirǝm gǝzǝn na Yam, kǝ dǝ shin wur ra. Wii ni ngap baa hukunte wur hoyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi bar kǝ nagǝr gon guri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu ra njon gip bom kǝ Yam las tu ba dom wurpi tu ɗiri Yami, tǝ den shini kandatu kan mbarǝm ba la wurpi su gip ba la'i wurpiyi ka gwa. Munju am ri wur kar gwa den la'i wurpi mǝn nartǝni. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ar ni guri gon muntu kan am ri ti kaar da gwa wi mir kabarshu rop su kǝ ba wurpiyika. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ar ni Yesu la bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, argon tu nagǝr guri kǝn kan am ri ti kaar da'a biwo, ar man kǝ nami mbarǝm kup. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Domici kup gǝzǝn bi ni gip womti bar ju wu ra nari gwa, ama tǝ ngapo gip holi bar kǝ am gǝs ni tǝ bi bar kup kan ne tǝra gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm den kandatu Bom kǝ Yam baa yaska gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu ba ɗǝl ter gip bom kǝ Yami ituwi, ar ni nǝm gip mǝn kulci kar ti wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, ɓa shin kiri tat ju! Ɓa shin bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am den tu'i bin ju!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin kiri tu'i bin ju ya? Baa yasika kup. Tat gon ra nǝm kan baa za den gon gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Halama kǝ patǝn kǝ zhan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Nan Yesu ra njon den tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaitun kan ba shin bom kǝ Yam suka gwa, ar ni Bitǝrus, na Yakubu, na Yohana, na Andǝrawus ngen momi kar ti mol, wu wule, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />&lt;&lt;Yari mi, gigasi ni bar ju baa pi we? Kan unu halama ni baa gode'e bar ju baa pi rawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, neni gere, ba dǝ murgon jili in nika da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mbarǝm na womti baa ɗir gip sun gǝni, wu wule wi ni'e ami, kan wu jili mbarǝm ka na womti. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kǝn ni kǝ kum den dlan na shirǝm kǝ dlanwo, ba ar tli in ni mbatl da'a. Ar nǝm dǝ bar ju pi, ama patǝn kǝ bar kup mbirawi da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Atl baa tli atl gami, kan dǝ mulki tli mulki gami. Atl baa jirkǝt ti kǝ ba lasi na womti, baa pi guzum esi. Ama munju kup ni'e kumi dliyi da'a. Pare kumi dli ni katl.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Ngup kǝn ni, domici wii ri in bom tloyi shirǝmi, dǝ ɓo in gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Baa ri in cina dǝ kiri kǝ bǝni na ga gunye domici kǝ sun gǝni, kǝ dǝ kǝ yari ni zo shirǝmi cina da wuri. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ama ar nǝm dǝ yari zo shirǝmi gip atl kundǝrǝndlip kan dǝ patǝn kǝ bar kup ɗiri. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Wokoci tu kup wu nǝm kǝn kan wu ri in bom tloyi shirǝmo, ba kǝ dam kǝn ni den argon tu nan kii yari gwa da'a. Yari ni argon tu kup ɗiri in gip mbatl gip wokociyi gwa, domici kǝn ni kǝ shirǝm da'a, Ruhu kǝ Yam ni. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Erim baa la'i gǝs yam erim gǝs kǝ dǝ ri ti eka, bǝba baa bi nya gǝska. Mimir baa tli ga mǝn gǝri gǝzǝn gami kǝ dǝ ri wur eka. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Mbarǝm kup baa nge in domici kǝ sun gǝni. Ama muntu kup ɓa mbatl dlom gam ar ri patǝn kǝ baro, tii zam ɗǝltǝne.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Kǝn ni kǝ shin bar kǝ tli mbatl mǝn ɗiri mǝshtǝn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daniyel 9.27</char></note> dlor kǝ ba las tu ar ndari dǝ shin ti dawo, na dǝ mǝn zhiti tulankuri momi. Ra untuwo, munju kan ra gip Yahudawo, wu kǝtǝr wu to gǝzǝn gip tlǝndǝre. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ba dǝ muntu nan to den gam kushi ka ɗǝl sur tǝ te gip bom kǝ pǝni argon da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Muntu ri gip kǝnka ngapo, ba tǝ pal ɗir kǝ pǝni bar kǝ ghumtǝn da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Kashto kǝ mǝtli mǝn tu'e na mǝn bi mimir nyin gip wokoci tu! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Shirǝm ni na Yami, ba dǝ kǝtǝr gin ɗir gip watlǝn da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Domici wokoci tawo baa kum dli kan taɓe kumi dagwa tun ne gǝs kǝ pi atl kundǝrǝndlip kan Yam pi gwa ar ri kǝkǝni. Baa'i pi wule muntu da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Dǝ wule Yam ca ni muri juka dawo, na nya mbarǝm gon ra kan baa zam ɗǝltǝn gwa da'a. Ama domici kǝ kumi guna kǝ munju tǝ zǝzariwo, ar ni tǝ ca muriyika. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Gip wokoci tawo, muntu kup wul kǝn'e &lt;&lt;Shin ni, Almasihun kǝni!&gt;&gt; Ko &lt;&lt;Shin ni, tin ta!&gt;&gt; Ba kǝ nǝm ni da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ga Almasihu kǝ lar na mǝn lar yari shirǝm kǝ Yam baa cwati. Wii gode halama na pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn kǝ dǝ wu jili mbarǝmka, ar ni baa piwo, har na munju zǝzar wur gwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ra untuwo, dǝm ni gǝɗǝn! A yari in bar kup wi kapǝn ar pi.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paltǝn sur kǝ Nya Mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ama den kaar kǝ kumi dli gip muri jawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">&lt;&lt;Pǝt baa palka dǝmǝni. Kyar es ba'i cir da'a.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ga zǝnges baa pi ta ndetǝn sur yami. Baa jirkǝt bar ju kan ra to yamka gwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishaya 13.10</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Wokoci ta ni baa shin Nya Mbarǝm den surtǝn gip dun yami, na bar ndǝrtǝni na ɗǝɗatǝne. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ar ni tii kar mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam suri, wu dom munju tǝ zǝzari gwa gip atl kundǝrǝndlip.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Kulci ni den kin turume. Wokoci tu kǝ shin am kini ba pika shendǝle ar pare bǝdlitǝno, kǝ mom ni'e watlǝn mbira kosak ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Untu ni esi, kǝn ni kǝ shin bar ju den pitǝno, ar mbira kosak bi bǝdlabǝn wi. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn baa mǝsh da'a, se bar ju ni kup pi wi gwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Dlom yam na atl baa paka, ama shirǝm gǝn baa pa da'a ko njem. <verse eid="MRK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Ama murgon ra mom pǝti ko awa tu kan ar ba pi gwa da'a, ko mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam kan to yamka gwa, ko Nyayi, se bǝbayi nan gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Dǝm ni gǝɗǝn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip tulankuri jeno wu rǝsh ni'e dǝm ni gǝɗǝn kǝ shirǝm ni na Yami.</char></note> kǝ neni gere, domici kǝ mom wokoci tu ar baa ɗir gwa da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ar ni wule mbarǝm kan ba ri kǝ ɓomi asǝm gwa. Ti ni tǝ ndarawo, tii za bomi am dǝ ga zher gǝsi, ko gonge gǝzǝn na mbap tu kan tii pi gwa. Kan tǝ wul mǝn ɓuti bǝdlabǝni'e tǝ dǝm gǝɗǝn.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />&lt;&lt;Ra untuwo, dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, domici kǝ mom wokoci tu babomi baa pal gwa da'a. Tii mani paltǝn kǝ siti, ko gip dlom gasi, ko wokoci la'i yar kǝ tus kori, ko kǝ bi cigǝni. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ba dǝ tǝ cwat curut bat na momi kan tǝ zam kǝn den umur da'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Argon tu a yari ino, ar ni a yari mbarǝm kup'e, dǝm ni gǝɗǝn!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Kiri kǝ bǝn mo bi kǝ ri Yesu eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Nan ar sa muri rop kǝ dǝ pi nyel jikat bǝdlabǝn na nyel kǝ burodi tu kan na yisti da gwawo, ar ni ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ngen tǝp tu wii nǝm Yesu mol wu ri ti eka gwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ama wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba'e wokoci kǝ nyel da'a bǝse dǝ mbarǝm tli bǝn gami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Nan Yesu ra bǝn kǝ Betani, bom dǝ mbarǝm gon kan ba wul ti'e Simon ba mǝn ndǝcci, tǝ den ci fingal ituwi, ar ni gǝr mǝtli gon ɗir na mbunlet kǝ tulare tu nan pi na tat onis gwa, laa'i na tulare mǝn bar wurpi mǝn tǝmi kasǝri. Kan tǝ ɓul mbumleti ka tǝ shoti Yesu mir sur gami. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ama munju ra lasi gwa kum lo'e kan wu wul ezin'e, &lt;&lt;Imnu li mir tuka untuwe? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ar baa mani dǝ wurka, dǝ zam wurpi mǝn nartǝn kan baa mbu ɓatli mǝn pi mbap kǝ nde pǝt hauya kutl cet nantam (300) gwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip Bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso ar man denarii hauya kutl cet nantam.</char></note> dǝ bi munju nan am ri wur kaar da gwa,&gt;&gt; ar ni wu matl ti hoyi.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Za tǝni, kǝ ghuntǝni kǝ unu? Ho bar ni tǝ nem den pi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ko gigasi kii nǝra na munju am ri wur kaar da gwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bi Doka kǝ rop 15.11</char></note> Kii ne wur am ra kup wokoci tu kǝ ndu gwa, ama aa nǝra nan kǝn ko gigasi da'a. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Tǝ pini argon tu tii mani pi gwa. Tǝ bǝrke ni dli gǝnka na mir den bi kapi gǝni. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, las tu kup baa pi la'i icin kǝ zo shirǝm tu gip atl kundǝrǝndlipo, baa pi ta yari argon tu nagǝr tu pi gwa kǝ dǝ dam ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Gip untuwo ar ni Yahuda Iskariyoti, nǝm gip kutl cet ropi, ri kar ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam kǝ dǝ tǝ bi Yesuka am da wuri. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Nan wu kum untuwo, wu pi ghol mbatl naari. Kan wu wule wii bi ti wurpi. Ar ni Yahuda pi ta ngeni tǝp tu kan tii bi Yesu kagwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ci fingal kǝ Babomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Den pǝt kǝ nǝm kǝ nyel kǝ bǝredi kan na yisti dagwa, den pǝt tu kan ba nbosh nye bagala kǝ nyel jikat bǝdlabǝn gwa. Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni kǝ ndu'e mǝ kǝrkǝmi i fingal jikat bǝdlabǝni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ar ni tǝ kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti rop, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Te ni gip bǝni, kii zam mbarǝm gon na tat mal gami, kop tǝ ni. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Bom tu kup tǝ te gipiwo, wul ni babomi'e, &lt;Ba mǝn kulci ba ndu tǝ mom kupshi tu nan tii ci nyel jikat bǝdlabǝn na mir mǝn kulci kar ti gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Tii ta'i in am den ɓiti bar kupshi gon kǝ to yami ka mun tu nan kǝrkǝmi kǝ ci nyeli gwa. Lasi ni kii kǝrkǝmi mi fingali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi tlyam, wu te gip bǝni, wu zam kandatu kan Yesu yari wur gwa. Kan wu kǝrkǝm fingal nyel jikat bǝdlabǝni.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet ropi ɗir bomi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Wi gip ci fingali ituwi, ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, nǝm gip kǝn ba ri kǝ bi gǝnka, ti ni'e muntu den ci fingal namǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ar ni dun mbatl nǝm mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi, kan wu nǝm wuli gǝs nǝm na nǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni da'a ko?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝm gip kutl cet rop ju ni, muntu den si am gip gal nǝm namǝn gwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nya mbarǝm baa mǝshi kandatu kan ar ra na rǝshi den ti gwa. Ama kashto kǝ muntu nan ba bi Nya mbarǝm kagwa! Ar baa mani mbarǝmi na gǝr tǝni dama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Wu gip ci fingali ituwi, ar ni Yesu pǝn bǝredi, tǝ gode Yami, tǝ njetǝli, tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar tu, nǝm ni. Muntuwo dli gǝn ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ar ni tǝ pǝn wuro mal inabiyi tǝ goode Yami, tǝ bi wuri. Kan kup gǝzǝn ba tla gipi. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo bǝran gǝn ni. Bǝran kǝ laa'i gudlum shǝrimi. Baa shoti ka den bi mbarǝm na womti. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, aa'i tla mal gǝri kin inabi kǝn da'a, se gas tu aa tla peli gip mulki kǝ Yam gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Nan wu wuli kono, ar ni wu ɗǝli kan wu to gǝzǝn den tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaitun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari'e Bitǝrus baa nge momi gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kii kǝtǝr gin kup kǝ za'ǝmi, kandatu nan ar ra na rǝshi gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;Aa ɓo mǝn le tǝmi,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;Tǝmi ngapo wii gǝzanka.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zakariya 13.7</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ama den kaar kǝ tlitǝn gǝn gip mǝshtǝno, aa mbubar cina da in su Galili ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Ar ni Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule kup gǝzǝn baa kǝtǝr wu za ki kawo, amo a za ki ka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari i, sekǝn gip gas kǝni, kapǝn dǝ tuskor la yar kǝ bisi ropo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen ra na kǝ &lt;&lt;bisi ropo&gt;&gt; da'a.</char></note> kii wule kǝ momǝn da'a biyi myakan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ama Bitǝrus pi ta yari na bar yar tǝ den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule baa rim ni eka nan kiwo, aa nge momi gi ka da'a.&gt;&gt; Kan nami mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi ma wu yari untu.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Wu ri las gon kan ba la ti bi'e Getsemani gwa, ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝm ni ɗe a ri shirǝm na Yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ar ni tǝ pǝn ga Bitǝrus, na Yakubu na Yohana nan ti. Ar ni tǝ nǝm pi dun mbatl na damtǝn na naari. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Dun mbatl tu kan ra gipǝno ar ba mani ri gǝn eka. Dǝm ni ɗe, kǝ neni gere.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nan tǝ te cina njemo, ar ni tǝ nda atli, tǝ shirǝm na Yam tǝ wule, ar ni baa piwo, dǝ pǝni ti wokoci kǝ kumi dli tu ka. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Abba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bǝba ituwi na bi Arameik</char></note> Bǝba, bar kup mǝn pitǝn ni kar ki. Pǝnim wuro mal kumi dli kǝn ka ngapi. Kup na untu, pi argon tu kǝ ndu gwa, ba'e argon tu nan a ndu gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni tǝ pal ɗir kar mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi myakan kan tǝ zam wur den nde umuri. Ar ni tǝ wul Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;Siman, umur ni kǝ den nde ya? Ase kii mani ne ger ko kǝ awa nǝm da'a ya? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ne ni gere kǝ shirǝm ni na Yami, bǝse kǝ nda nika gip godetǝne. Ar tu ruhu nǝm wi ama dliwo ndǝri ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ar ni tǝ pa pal rǝnka, tǝ shirǝm na Yam wule kǝ hari. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nan tǝ pal ɗiro, ar ni tǝ pa zam wur den nde umuri, domici ger gǝzǝn raka laa'i na umuri. Wu hol ar gon tu nan wii yari ti gwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ar ni tǝ pa pal ɗir kǝ bisi myakani tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝn ma umur ni kǝn den nde na shukutǝna? Ar pi wi! Wokoci pi wi nan baa bi Nya mbarǝmka am dǝ mǝn warwat pitǝne. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Tli ni yam mǝ ndanira! Mǝn bi gǝn tu mbira wi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi Yesuka kan ba nǝm ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu den shirǝm ituwi, ar ni Yahuda cwati, nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet rop ju. Tǝ ɗir na mbarǝm na womti kan ra na kiri sǝɓǝri na dlo am da wuri. Ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa, na kiri kǝ bǝn ni kar wur ɗiri.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yahuda tare bi wur halama wi'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu a pi ti sumbawo, ti ni'e mbarǝmi. Nǝm tǝni kǝ ndanira nan ti. Kan kǝ ne ni ger den ti hoyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Na ɗirtǝn gǝs kar Yesuwo, ar ni Yahuda wul ti'e,&lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci!&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ pi ti sumba.<verse eid="MRK 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ar ni mbarǝmi dǝl Yesu teri, kan wu nǝm ti. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kano nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu kan ra dlor kosak nan ti ba tus bar sǝɓǝr gǝs tǝ wotl kǝm kǝ zher kǝ bar lǝɓa kǝ Yam nari.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ɗǝl ɗir na sǝɓǝr na dlo kǝ nǝmi gǝn wule mǝn tli bǝn mbatl gona? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ko gigasi ami ra nan kǝn gip bom kǝ Yam ami den kulci mbarǝme ama kǝ nǝmǝn da'a. Ar pini untu kǝ dǝ laa'i rǝshi shirǝm kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Bar tuwo ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi kup kǝtǝr gǝzǝn wu za ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Nye moni gon ra kop Yesu kaar nye pǝrsi nye pǝrsiyi, tǝra na lulur da'a, se bar kǝ ghumtǝn gǝs katl. Nan wu ndu'e wu nǝm tiwo, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ar ni tǝ za bar kǝ ghumtǝni am da wuri tǝ kǝtǝr tǝ ndara gǝs koni.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ar ni wu ndara na Yesu kar bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami, na ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami, na kiri kǝ bǝni, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ba dom wur kup lasi. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Bitǝrus kop Yesu nye pǝrsi nye pǝrsiyi. Tǝ kop ti tǝ te gip dǝbom bom kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. Lasi ni tǝ dǝm na mǝn ne ger den bomi, tǝ den kumi utu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam na nami mǝn domtǝn kǝ mǝn ne ger den shirǝm pi ta ngeni argon tu wii yari den ti'e tǝ nda kawi kǝ dǝ wu ri ti e ra gwa, ama wu zam da'a. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Mbarǝm na womti bi seda kǝ lar den ti, ama bǝ gǝzǝn nda nǝm da'a. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Den kaariwo ar ni jen tlyam dlor, wu bi seda kǝ lar kǝn den Yesu, wu wule, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ kum tǝ wule tii yas bom kǝ Yam kǝn kan mbarǝm tu gwa, tǝ tu gon gip muri myakan, muntu kan mbarǝm ni tu da gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kup na untu seda kǝ bi gǝzǝn nda nǝm da'a.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ar ni bar lǝɓa kǝ Yam tli yam tǝ dlǝr gip dlom gǝzǝn, tǝ ngen momi kar Yesu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ra na shirǝm tu nan ki bali gwa diya? Im ni na seda tu nan wi den bi den ki gwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ama Yesu sa gǝs shot, tǝ bali ti na argon da'a, Bar lǝɓa kǝ Yami pa ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ko ki ni'e Almasihu Nya Mǝn Albarka tu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Ar ni Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni. Eso kii shin Nya Mbarǝm njon den am shimli kǝ Mǝn Nartǝni, ti den surtǝn gip dun yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ar ni bar lǝɓayi kǝ Yami tlyat lulur gǝska, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unu seda ni mǝ pa ngen esi? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ar tu kǝ kum mǝgǝn shirǝm tu tǝ yari den Yam gwa wi! Unun kǝ shini?&gt;&gt; Ar ni mbarǝmi kup wule ar ndari dǝ ri ti eka. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ar ni jen bǝse ti mo'ǝmi, kan wu ɓali ti ba ger ka, wu pa la'i ti ankayama, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, wo ni ɓo iwe!&gt;&gt; Mǝn ne ger den bomi ma ar ni wu pi ta ɓe gǝsi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus wule tǝ mom Yesu da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Nan Bitǝrus ra sur gǝsi gip dǝbom bomiwo, ar ni nye gǝr gon gip mir mǝn pii mbap bar lǝɓa kǝ Yami ɗir lasi. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nan tǝ ti shin Bitǝrus den kumi utuwo, ar ni tǝ shin ti ndin, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ma na Yesu kǝ Nazarat tu ni ki ra!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ama Bitǝrus nge gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom argon tu kǝ shirǝm dene gwa da'a. Amo a mom da'a!&gt;&gt; Nan tǝ yari untuwo, ar ni tǝ tlyam tǝ te gǝs gip dlabǝn bomi.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Nan nye gǝri pa shinti lasiwo, ar ni tǝ yari munju ra dlor lasi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu ma gip wur ni tǝra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ar ni Bitǝrus pa nge gǝsi. Ar ri kǝtigon da'a, ar ni munju kan ra dlor kar Bitǝrus gwa ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni, ki ma gip wur ni kira, domici ki mbarǝm kǝ Galili ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ar ni Bitǝrus pa nǝm wotli bes shirǝmi tǝ den pi bi gam gǝsi, na ɓe am atl cina da wuri tǝ den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;A mom mbarǝm tu kan kǝ shirǝm den ti gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Na yari untuwo, ar ni tus kor la yar kǝ bisi ropi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen ra na &lt;&lt;kǝ bisi ropi&gt;&gt; da'a.</char></note> Ar ni Bitǝrus dami shirǝm tu kan Yesu yari ti gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Kapǝn dǝ tus kor la yar kǝ bisi ropo, kii wule kǝ momǝn da'a biyi myakan.&gt;&gt; Nan tǝ dam ti den shirǝm tuwo, ar ni tǝ mbutl na kulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ri Yesu cina dǝ gobna Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Kǝ bi cigǝni, ar ni ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yami na kiri kǝ bǝni, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa, na kup nami mǝn domtǝn kǝ mǝn ne ger den shirǝm dar bi dene. Kan wu ɓal Yesuka, wu ndara nan ti cina dǝ Bilatus. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Bilatus ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ya?&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu bali ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Untu ni kǝ yari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Kan ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam ba ne ti bes shirǝm gami den bar na womti. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Ar ni Bilatus pa ngen momi kar ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar tu wu ne'i den ne bes shirǝm gam den bar na womti, kii bali diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ama har kǝkǝn ma Yesu sa gǝs shot, ar ni ar ghun Bilatus.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tloyi Yesu hukuntetǝn kǝ mǝshtǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ar dǝm'e den kandatu tǝ kur pi gwa, gunyi ba kur pǝtli mǝn Yahudayi nǝm gip munju ra na ɓali gip bom moni kan wu liri gwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Rawo, mbarǝm gon ra kan ba la ti bi'e Barabas gwa ra na ɓali gip bom moni na mir mǝn tli mǝn bǝn mbatl yami kan wu ri gon eka wokoci gon kǝ tli mǝn bǝn mbatl yami. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ar ni womti mbarǝmi ɗir wu nǝm liri Bilatus kǝ dǝ tǝ pi wur argon tu tǝ kur pi gwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Bilatus bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ndu'e a pǝtli in gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Domici tǝ mom'e ghuve ni kem ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam kǝ bi Yesuka am da ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ar ni ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam ba co mbarǝm kǝ dǝ wu wule dǝ pǝtli wur Barabas den ami kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Ar ni Bilatus ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kan unun aa pi na muntu kǝ wul ti'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ar ni wu wom bar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bilatus wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Den unu? Unu wani bar ni tǝ piwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu pa wom bar hoyi wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Nan tǝ ndu'e tǝ gholi womti mbarǝmi mbatlo, ar ni tǝ pǝtli wur Barabas. Nan tǝ kem ɓo Yesu na rǝɓawo ar ni tǝ taa ti am da wur kǝ dǝ ɓa tika den kini.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Kan ga mǝn bi utuyi ba ndara na Yesu gip dlabǝn bom kǝ ga mǝn bi utuyi, bom dǝ gobnayi las tu ba la ti bi'e,&lt;&lt;Pǝritoriyom&gt;&gt; gwa. Ar ni wu dom nami mǝn bi utuyi kup. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ar ni wu la'i ti tlyari lulur gon wule zili yape, wu pa pi posh gam ka ire. Wu kemi ti sur gami. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ar ni wu nǝm shirmi gǝsi wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ Yam za ki ra, gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Eso, wu pi ta ɓe gǝs sur gami na dlo, wu pi ta bǝse ti mo'ǝmi. Kan wu ngus gip lo'i gǝs den wu ne ti den bi nartǝni. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nan wu pa'i lo'i gǝso, ar ni wu tus tlyari zili luluri ka, kan wu la'i ti lulur gǝsi. Kan wu ɗǝli ti te kaarika kǝ dǝ ɓa tika den kini.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓa Yesuka den kini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Wu den ndaratǝno, ar ni wu mo na mbarǝm gon den ɓomi asǝme, mǝn sun Simon, mbarǝm kǝ Sayirin, basi ga Alekzanda na Rufus, tǝ ɗǝl ter gip nye bǝni, ar ni wu kem ti kǝ pǝni kin ɓa'i kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Wu ri Yesu las gon kan ba wul ti'e Golgota gwa, las kǝ kula gam ituwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Lasi ni wu taˈi ti mal inabi kurtli na mur, kan tǝ nge tleka. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ar ni wu ɓa tika den kini. Wu pa rabe tutul gǝs gip dlom gǝzǝni, wu la guri'a dene wu shin argon tu ko gonge gǝzǝn baa zam gwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bar kǝ gǝlla am ghanum ni kǝ cigǝni ni wu ɓa ti den kini. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Den kin tu ɓa tikawo, ar ni wu rǝsh bar tu wu shin bes gǝs dene gwa'e, &lt;&lt;GUN KƏ MƏN YAHUDA.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Wu pa ɓa mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝp jen rop nan ti, nǝm den am shimli gǝsi, nǝmi ngapo den am yali gǝsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />(Muntuwo den bi laa'itǝn kǝ rǝshi shirǝm kǝ Yam ni'e, &lt;&lt;Dlǝm ti gip mǝn wani pitǝne.&gt;&gt;)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor rǝshi tulankuri jen ra na aya tu da'a.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mbarǝm kan ba kop tǝp lasi gwa pi ta yari shirǝm mburtǝne, wu den kungǝt gami, wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Hahaha! Ki kan kii yas bom kǝ Yamka, kǝ pa tu gip muri myakano, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />se kǝ ɗǝl sur den kini, kǝ ɗǝli gam gi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Untu ni es ga kiri lǝɓa kǝ Yam gwa, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa pi ta pi ti mǝgǝn shirǝm gip dlom gǝzǝni, wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ɗǝli jeni, ama tii mani ɗǝli gam gǝs da'a! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Naa dǝ Almasihu tu, e gun kǝ Israˈila ɗǝl sur den kin ɓatǝni kǝkǝn mǝ shini, kǝ dǝ mǝn ma mǝ ngǝsh mi den ti ra!&gt;&gt; Mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝp ju nan ɓa wur nan ti ma pi ti mǝgǝn shirǝmi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Gip dlom pǝte, ar ni dǝmǝn nga gip atli ka kup, ar ba ri gǝlla am myakan kǝ pǝte. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ra untuwo, nan ar ri gǝlla am myakan kǝ pǝto, ar ni Yesu tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi lamasabaktani?&gt;&gt; Muntu ba pi nupi'e &lt;&lt;Yam gǝni, Yam gǝni, unun kem kǝ balǝm kaar we?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabura 22.1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Nan jen kan ra dlor lasi kum untuwo ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa kum ni, tǝ den laˈi bi mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Iliya wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ar ni nǝm gip wur tli na kǝtǝre, tǝ gii sonso na mati mal gǝri kiin inabi, tǝ ɓal den dlo tǝ taˈi Yesu kǝ dǝ tǝ tla, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Naa mi shini in Iliya mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam baa ɗir tǝ ɗǝli ti sur ka gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ar ni Yesu tli yar hoyi tǝ dǝl bar shukutǝni, kan tǝ kotl mbatlka.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ar ni labǝle kǝ te gip bom kǝ Yamka ba tarka sur gip dlomi, argon tu nǝm sur yami har su atlka. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Nan bar mǝn bi utu kan dlor lasi shin kandatu Yesu mǝsho, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi, mbarǝm tuwo, Nya Yam ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Mǝtli jen dlǝr teka jen wu den shini. Gip wuro Maryamu kǝ Magadala ra, na Maryamu nasi Yakubu heli na Isubu, na Salomi esi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ter Galili ni mǝtli ju kop ti wu den pi ti mbapi. Mǝtli jen na womti kan kop ti kaar tor Urshalima ma ra lasi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Kǝ sitiwo pǝt kǝrkǝm bar ni domici gǝniwo pǝt shukutǝn ni. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Ar ni mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Isubu, mbarǝm kǝ Arǝmatiya ɗiri. Ti ma nǝm ni gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda, mǝn pitǝn dlat ni esi, ti ni den ɓuti cwattǝn kǝ mulki kǝ Yami. Tǝ ɓa bi gul tǝ ri kar Bilatus, tǝ liri dǝ bi ti dli kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Bilatus nǝm bi na ame nan tǝ kum'e Yesu mǝsh kawi gwa. Ar ni tǝ la bi bar mǝn bi utuyi tǝ ngen momi kar ti, ko na ho bi ni Yesu mǝsh kawi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nan tǝ kum bi dǝ bar mǝn bi utuyiwo, ar ni tǝ bi Isubu dli kǝ Yesuyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ar ni Isubu wur tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝm ɗiri, tǝ shu dli kǝ Yesu suri, kan tǝ ghumka na tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝmi, tǝ mur ti gip gambǝci tu kan tǝ bor gip shu tat gwa. Kan tǝ kutǝl bar tat ɗiri tǝ le bisika na ri. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maryamu kǝ Magadala na Maryamu nas kǝ Isubu shin las tu muri dli kǝ Yesu gwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Tlitǝn kǝ Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nan pǝt Asabar pǝt shukutǝn bi karwo, ar ni Maryamu kǝ Magadala, na Maryamu nasi Yakubu na Salomi, wur bar mǝn tǝmi kasǝr ɗiri kǝ dǝ wu ri bǝrke dli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ba pini untu kǝ dǝ gode ndutǝn tu kan ba pi mbarǝm tu kan mshkawi gwa, kǝ dǝ ca usuntǝnka.</char></note> kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Den pǝt kǝ nǝm kǝ sati, kǝ cigǝni wokoci ɗǝltǝn kǝ pǝt tori, ar ni wu ri kǝ ba gambǝci'i. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Nan wu ra den ritǝno, wu wul ezǝn'e &lt;&lt;Wo ni baa kutǝli mi tat tu kan le gambǝci'i na ri kawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nan wu tli ger wu shin gambǝci'iwo, ar ni wu shin kutǝl bar tati kawi.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nan wu su gip gambǝci'iwo, ar ni wu shin nye mbarǝm gon njon den am shimli, na ghol lulur gi dli gǝsi, kan wu kum bǝrti. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ar ni nye mbarǝmi wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba ar dǝmi in bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn da'a. Kǝn ni den ngeni Yesu kǝ Nazarat muntu ɓa tika den kin gwa ya? Ar tu ngap ti'i da'a, tǝ tli gǝs wi. Las tu mur ti gwan kǝni! <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Kǝkǝno ri yari ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti, na Bitǝrus'e tii mbubar Galili cina da wuri. Barta ni wii shin ti kandatu nan tǝ yari in gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ar ni mǝtliyi ɗǝl na kǝtǝre, dǝmǝn gam nǝm wur wi, dli gǝzǝn den dǝdartǝni. Wu wul murgon'e argon da'a, domici bǝrti den ci gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Nan Yesu tli gip mǝshi mbarǝmo, kǝ bi cǝgǝni den pǝt kǝ nǝm kǝ sati, ar ni tǝ pare ɗǝltǝn kar Maryamu kǝ Magadala, nagǝr tu kan Yesu ɗǝli ti dun itǝr nyingi gip tli gǝska gwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Nagǝr mbarǝmi eso, ar ni tǝ ri yari mbarǝm ju nan ra na Yesu tun har gwa, munju kan ra den dun mbatl na kulu gwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ama nan wu kum'e Yesu ra na ge mbatl gǝsi, har Maryamu ma tǝ shin tiwo, wu ngǝsh wur dene da'a.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝl kar mbarǝm rop gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Den kaar kǝ muntuwo, ar ni Yesu sanje kama gǝska, kan tǝ ɗǝl kar mbarǝm jen rop gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti wokoci tu nan wu den ritǝn gip nye bǝn gon gwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ar ni wu rop ju pal rǝnka wu ri yari nami, ama wu la shirǝmi gip mbatl da'a.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Den kaariwo Yesu ɗǝl kar kutl cet nǝm ju wokoci tu nan wu den ci fingal gwa. Ar ni tǝ matl wur den nge ngǝshtǝn den Yam na lati gam gǝzǝni, domici wu nǝm argon tu munju shin ti den kaar kǝ tlitǝn gǝs yari gwa da'a.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ri nǝka ko ako gip atl kundǝrǝndlip, kǝ yari ni mbarǝm kup zo shirǝm tu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Muntu kup ngǝsh ti den shirǝmiwo, baa pi ti batismawo, tii zam ɗǝltǝne. Ama muntu kup nǝsh den shirǝmi dawo, baa hukunte ti. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Bar ju kan munju ngǝsh wur demǝn baa pi kǝ bi seda gwa ni'e, gip sun gǝno, wii dǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme, wii pa shirǝm gip pel bi jeni. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Wii pǝn ici na am gǝzǝni. Eso wi ni wu tla uun mǝn ri mbarǝm ekawo, ar ba pi wur argon da'a. Wii pa ne am gǝzǝn den mǝn kumi dli, kan wu warke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Den kaar kǝ shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu nan wuro, ar ni pǝn tika to yamka, tǝ dǝm den am shimli kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi ngapo, kan wu ɗǝl wu pi ta pi wazu ko ako. Babom es kop nan wuri, tǝ den kopi kaar kǝ shirǝm gǝzǝn tǝp kǝ ba pi halamu bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju kan tǝ kem wu pi gwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>